window.CARDS=window.CARDS||{};CARDS["story-v-y1v9-index"]=[{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p6-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"nagumo-miyabi hoshinomiya-chie horikita-manabu ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami prologue  the criminal letter and the council interview ichinose narrates her middle school life and the mistake that followed  the letter  ichinose honami is a criminal  appears at school  then a one on one student council interview with vice president nagumo on a day off  p 7  first person retrospective that insists on an  honest me  and an oath to face her own answer rather than run   i ve never thought of myself as either a  good person  or a  bad person  student council president in her third year of middle school and offered a private high school scholarship  sports were difficult but she put in as much effort as in studies  built a comfortable school and private life before the unforgivable mistake   her mother s illness and her little sister being left a shell of herself  wasted half her third year of middle school and was a shut in for half a year  the letter froze her while classmates turned with curious looks  to put an end to that past by enrolling here  so her mother and little sister can smile again    that s why i won t run from my own  answer  interviewed by vice president nagumo after president horikita rejected her application  she tells him everything about her  mistake  under his assurance that the secret will not leave the room  nagumo cites her entrance exam results as reported by hoshinomiya sensei  her homeroom teacher  president horikita interviewed and rejected her council application  nagumo lies that the rejection was for not being class a and that horikita obsesses over status  the prologue never prints the full content of her  mistake  beyond the letter s accusation and the family aftermath already narrated  the interview scene is third person around her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p6-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p6-1\">Prologue: the criminal letter and the council interview<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.6–11<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ichinose narrates her middle-school life and the mistake that followed; the letter “‘Ichinose Honami is a criminal.’” appears at school, then a one-on-one student-council interview with Vice President Nagumo on a day off (p.7).<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hoshinomiya-chie.html\">Hoshinomiya Chie<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-manabu.html\">Horikita Manabu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> “I’ve never thought of myself as either a ‘good person’ or a ‘bad person’.”<span class=\"pg\">p.6<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Voice<\/span> First-person retrospective that insists on an ‘honest me’ and an oath to face her own answer rather than run.<span class=\"pg\">p.6<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Student council president in her third year of middle school and offered a private high school scholarship; sports were difficult but she put in as much effort as in studies.<span class=\"pg\">p.6<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Built a comfortable school and private life before the unforgivable mistake — her mother’s illness and her little sister being left a shell of herself.<span class=\"pg\">p.6<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> Wasted half her third year of middle school and was a shut-in for half a year; the letter froze her while classmates turned with curious looks.<span class=\"pg\">p.7<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Goal<\/span> To put an end to that past by enrolling here, so her mother and little sister can smile again — “That’s why I won’t run from my own ‘answer’.”<span class=\"pg\">p.7<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Interviewed by Vice President Nagumo after President Horikita rejected her application; she tells him everything about her ‘mistake’ under his assurance that the secret will not leave the room.<span class=\"pg\">p.7–11<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hoshinomiya Chie<\/b> Nagumo cites her entrance-exam results as reported by Hoshinomiya-sensei, her homeroom teacher.<span class=\"pg\">p.8<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Manabu<\/b> President Horikita interviewed and rejected her council application; Nagumo lies that the rejection was for not being Class A and that Horikita obsesses over status.<span class=\"pg\">p.8–9<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The prologue never prints the full content of her ‘mistake’ beyond the letter’s accusation and the family aftermath already narrated; the interview scene is third-person around her.<span class=\"pg\">p.6–11<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p16-1\">→ After: Target of Sakayanagi’s planned attack<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y1v9-p7-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami horikita-manabu hoshinomiya-chie nagumo-miyabi","q":"nagumo miyabi vice presidential interview of ichinose student council room on a day off  vice president nagumo interviews first year class b ichinose honami one on one after president horikita rejected her application   1st year  class b  ichinose honami  huh  seeks her chiefly as personal property   class b like himself and outstanding grades are bonuses  the important question is whether she is worth keeping at his side   i hear you were on the student council  and student council president no less  during middle school   i heard from your homeroom teacher  hoshinomiya sensei  looks like your results on the entrance exams were also outstanding  lies that horikita rejected ichinose out of hand for not being class a and that the man obsesses over status   the narration states horikita assesses talent from d or a alike   it s because president horikita s a strict person  in all likelihood  he already rejected you out of hand because you re not in class a  claims he confessed the full truth behind his own class b assignment when applying to the council and that it resulted in his current position  refuses to say what that confession was   sorry but i have no intention of answering that  right now  the one being questioned is you  ichinose  presses why a student with her grades  interpersonal skills and middle school presidency is in class    there must be some reason for that   someone who is unable to grab hold of this opportunity has no place in the student council   it won t leave this room  of course  your secret is our secret  interviewer who extracts her secret under a promise of confidentiality while framing her as prospective personal property  slanders horikita s standards to ichinose  the narration marks the slander as a lie  obtains ichinose s entrance exam results from hoshinomiya sensei","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y1v9-p7-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html#sc-nagumo-miyabi-y1v9-p7-1\">Vice presidential interview of Ichinose<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.7–11<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Student council room on a day off; Vice President Nagumo interviews first-year Class B Ichinose Honami one-on-one after President Horikita rejected her application.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-manabu.html\">Horikita Manabu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hoshinomiya-chie.html\">Hoshinomiya Chie<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> “1st year, Class B, Ichinose Honami, huh?”<span class=\"pg\">p.7<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> “I hear you were on the student council, and student council president no less, during middle school?”<span class=\"pg\">p.8<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> “I heard from your homeroom teacher, Hoshinomiya-sensei. Looks like your results on the entrance exams were also outstanding.”<span class=\"pg\">p.8<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>11 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Seeks her chiefly as personal property — Class B like himself and outstanding grades are bonuses; the important question is whether she is worth keeping at his side.<span class=\"pg\">p.8<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Tactic<\/span> Lies that Horikita rejected Ichinose out of hand for not being Class A and that the man obsesses over status — the narration states Horikita assesses talent from D or A alike.<span class=\"pg\">p.9<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It’s because President Horikita’s a strict person. In all likelihood, he already rejected you out of hand because you’re not in Class A.”<span class=\"pg\">p.9<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Claims he confessed the full truth behind his own Class B assignment when applying to the council and that it resulted in his current position; refuses to say what that confession was.<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Sorry but I have no intention of answering that. Right now, the one being questioned is you, Ichinose.”<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Goal<\/span> Presses why a student with her grades, interpersonal skills and middle-school presidency is in Class — “There must be some reason for that.”<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Someone who is unable to grab hold of this opportunity has no place in the student council.”<span class=\"pg\">p.11<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It won’t leave this room, of course. Your secret is our secret.”<span class=\"pg\">p.11<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Interviewer who extracts her secret under a promise of confidentiality while framing her as prospective personal property.<span class=\"pg\">p.7–11<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Manabu<\/b> Slanders Horikita’s standards to Ichinose; the narration marks the slander as a lie.<span class=\"pg\">p.9<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hoshinomiya Chie<\/b> Obtains Ichinose’s entrance-exam results from Hoshinomiya-sensei.<span class=\"pg\">p.8<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y1v9-p14-1\">→ After: Audience with Sakayanagi; Kōenji’s point loophole<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-horikita-manabu-y1v9-p8-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"ichinose-honami nagumo-miyabi sakayanagi-arisu horikita-manabu","q":"horikita manabu rejected applicant  slandered standards  broken trust prologue recall  president horikita interviewed ichinose and rejected her student council application  nagumo s interview follows  interviewed and rejected ichinose s council application  narration does not state his reason on these pages  nagumo lies that horikita obsesses over status when speaking to ichinose  contrasts his own violence policy with  horikita senpai  admits he lost horikita senpai s trust and planned the break from the beginning  narration  at first glance he looks like someone who would obsess over status  but the truth is the opposite   he assesses whether a student is from class d or class a and evaluates talent  sakayanagi asks nagumo whether horikita senpai recommended her for the council  she later presses nagumo on throwing away the trust he established with horikita manabu  always  horikita senpai  or  horikita manabu  in these pages   never bare  horikita  as a first year reference","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-horikita-manabu-y1v9-p8-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/horikita-manabu.html#sc-horikita-manabu-y1v9-p8-1\">Rejected applicant, slandered standards, broken trust<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.8–9, 14, 19, 23<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-manabu.html\">Horikita Manabu<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Prologue recall: President Horikita interviewed Ichinose and rejected her student-council application; Nagumo’s interview follows.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Interviewed and rejected Ichinose’s council application; narration does not state his reason on these pages.<span class=\"pg\">p.8<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Nagumo lies that Horikita obsesses over status when speaking to Ichinose; contrasts his own violence policy with “Horikita-senpai”; admits he lost Horikita-senpai’s trust and planned the break from the beginning.<span class=\"pg\">p.9, 19, 23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Narration: at first glance he looks like someone who would obsess over status, but the truth is the opposite — he assesses whether a student is from Class D or Class A and evaluates talent.<span class=\"pg\">p.9<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Sakayanagi asks Nagumo whether Horikita-senpai recommended her for the council; she later presses Nagumo on throwing away the trust he established with Horikita Manabu.<span class=\"pg\">p.14, 23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Always “Horikita-senpai” or “Horikita Manabu” in these pages — never bare “Horikita” as a first-year reference.<span class=\"pg\">p.14, 19, 23<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v9-p8-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami nagumo-miyabi hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie named as ichinose s homeroom teacher during the prologue interview  nagumo cites information obtained from ichinose s homeroom teacher  identified as ichinose s homeroom teacher  reported her entrance exam results to nagumo   i heard from your homeroom teacher  hoshinomiya sensei  looks like your results on the entrance exams were also outstanding  hoshinomiya does not appear in person  only named as the source of nagumo s information","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v9-p8-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hoshinomiya-chie.html#sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v9-p8-1\">Named as Ichinose’s homeroom teacher<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.8<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hoshinomiya-chie.html\">Hoshinomiya Chie<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">During the prologue interview, Nagumo cites information obtained from Ichinose’s homeroom teacher.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> “I heard from your homeroom teacher, Hoshinomiya-sensei. Looks like your results on the entrance exams were also outstanding.”<span class=\"pg\">p.8<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Identified as Ichinose’s homeroom teacher; reported her entrance-exam results to Nagumo.<span class=\"pg\">p.8<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Hoshinomiya does not appear in person; only named as the source of Nagumo’s information.<span class=\"pg\">p.8<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y1v9-p14-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"action spoken","w":"sakayanagi-arisu kouenji-rokusuke ryuuen-kakeru sudou-ken ishizaki-daichi ayanokouji-kiyotaka horikita-manabu nagumo-miyabi","q":"nagumo miyabi audience with sakayanagi  koenji s point loophole early february after the training camp  sakayanagi arisu visits the student council room  which nagumo has remade in his own formal style   did horikita senpai recommend you for the student council  by any chance   by showing me an appropriate amount of talent  that s the only way  first off  it s not too late to join the student council you know  come over to my side  sakayanagi   both you and ryuuen  we ve got a lot of interesting 1st years this year  don t we  mentions another  1st year  has an appointment to hurry sakayanagi  previously shared information with her about ichinose   i don t recall giving you permission to  go that far  sakayanagi   honami is my personal property i plan on loving  i only gave you permission to weaken her a bit   you re a bold woman  aren t you afraid of me  only authorized weakening of ichinose  not expulsion  treats the possibility of expulsion as beyond the permission he granted   very well  sakayanagi  the student council too will turn a blind eye to your actions  narration  not the least bit trustworthy  will throw away someone who could become an asset for the student council   unfortunately for you  i don t particularly dislike the use of violence either   unlike horikita senpai  i don t plan to crack down on them either  for the sudo ishizaki fight he would not push to expulsion   he would suspend the parties involved rather than hand down a harsher sentence than the previous president   koenji seems to be the only one in possession of an amount greater than what the school permits after all  it s a form of rule violation  private points are collected at graduation and worthless afterward  a third year may entrust them to an underclassman  he wants the 20 million point class a rule revised and says repeal would not apply to the first years  koenji s pre graduation purchases tipped the school off to a loophole   i definitely lost horikita senpai s trust and the trust of the students of 3rd year class a  deliberately threw away horikita senpai s trust during the training camp  narration  even breaking the rules established with horikita manabu had been planned from the beginning   ayanokoji  i am somewhat familiar with that name  he s a 1st year  is he not  ends the ayanokoji topic when sakayanagi says she does not know the name  refuses her offer to investigate him  receives her report on the planned ichinose attack  grants the council a blind eye  debates violence and point rules  and asks about ayanokoji  koenji s private points conversation at the training camp is the source sakayanagi reopens  nagumo treats koenji as the rule violating holder of excess points  names ryuuen with sakayanagi as an interesting first year who would not hesitate to make enemies of anyone  recalls the class d class c fight involving sudou and ishizaki s groups when asked how he would have sentenced it  same fight recollection   he would suspend rather than expel  asks sakayanagi about ayanokoji by name and then drops the subject  contrasts his own council posture with horikita senpai s  admits losing horikita senpai s trust  planned the break with manabu from the start","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y1v9-p14-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html#sc-nagumo-miyabi-y1v9-p14-1\">Audience with Sakayanagi; Kōenji’s point loophole<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.14–24<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Early February after the training camp; Sakayanagi Arisu visits the student council room, which Nagumo has remade in his own formal style.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kouenji-rokusuke.html\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> <span class=\"n\">+1 more<\/span><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> “Did Horikita-senpai recommend you for the student council, by any chance?”<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> “By showing me an appropriate amount of talent. That’s the only way. First off, it’s not too late to join the student council you know? Come over to my side, Sakayanagi.”<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> “Both you and Ryuuen. We’ve got a lot of interesting 1st years this year, don’t we?”<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>23 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Tactic<\/span> Mentions another ‘1st year’ has an appointment to hurry Sakayanagi; previously shared information with her about Ichinose.<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I don’t recall giving you permission to ‘go that far’, Sakayanagi.”<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Honami is my personal property I plan on loving. I only gave you permission to weaken her a bit.”<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You’re a bold woman. Aren’t you afraid of me?”<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Goal<\/span> Only authorized weakening of Ichinose, not expulsion; treats the possibility of expulsion as beyond the permission he granted.<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Very well, Sakayanagi. The student council too will turn a blind eye to your actions.”<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Narration: not the least bit trustworthy; will throw away someone who could become an asset for the student council.<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Unfortunately for you, I don’t particularly dislike the use of violence either.”<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Unlike Horikita-senpai, I don’t plan to crack down on them either”<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> For the Sudō–Ishizaki fight he would not push to expulsion — he would suspend the parties involved rather than hand down a harsher sentence than the previous president.<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Kōenji seems to be the only one in possession of an amount greater than what the school permits after all. It’s a form of rule violation.”<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> Private points are collected at graduation and worthless afterward; a third year may entrust them to an underclassman; he wants the 20-million-point Class A rule revised and says repeal would not apply to the first years; Kōenji’s pre-graduation purchases tipped the school off to a loophole.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I definitely lost Horikita-senpai’s trust and the trust of the students of 3rd year Class A.”<span class=\"pg\">p.23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Tactic<\/span> Deliberately threw away Horikita-senpai’s trust during the training camp; narration: even breaking the rules established with Horikita Manabu had been planned from the beginning.<span class=\"pg\">p.23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Ayanokōji…? I am somewhat familiar with that name. He’s a 1st year, is he not?”<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Ends the Ayanokōji topic when Sakayanagi says she does not know the name; refuses her offer to investigate him.<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Receives her report on the planned Ichinose attack, grants the council a blind eye, debates violence and point rules, and asks about Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.14–24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/b> Kōenji’s private-points conversation at the training camp is the source Sakayanagi reopens; Nagumo treats Kōenji as the rule-violating holder of excess points.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–21<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Names Ryuuen with Sakayanagi as an interesting first year who would not hesitate to make enemies of anyone.<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Recalls the Class D–Class C fight involving Sudou and Ishizaki’s groups when asked how he would have sentenced it.<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Same fight recollection — he would suspend rather than expel.<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Asks Sakayanagi about Ayanokōji by name and then drops the subject.<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Manabu<\/b> Contrasts his own council posture with Horikita-senpai’s; admits losing Horikita-senpai’s trust; planned the break with Manabu from the start.<span class=\"pg\">p.14, 19, 23<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-nagumo-miyabi-y1v9-p7-1\">← Before: Vice presidential interview of Ichinose<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y1v9-p14-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"nagumo-miyabi ichinose-honami ayanokouji-kiyotaka kushida-kikyou sakayanagi-arisu","q":"sakayanagi arisu student council visit  kushida outside the door early february after the training camp  sakayanagi visits second year president nagumo in the remade student council room  then meets kushida kikyo outside   the student council room has become rather flashy  it s completely different from the way it used to be  cool appraisal that reads the room as a symbol of nagumo s might rather than a working council chamber   let s not  i think it would be a problem for there to be two leaders in one organization  declines nagumo s invitation to join while implying equality or superiority to him as a first year  he does not grow angry  came to tell nagumo she will attack student council member ichinose honami san and that it may get stormy   with information he previously supplied  presses him on permission  expulsion risk  violence policy and the 20 million point rule  accepts his blind eye pledge  offers to investigate ayanokoji when he raises the name   so you  won t mind it if she does end up getting expelled   it s just in my nature  stands her ground when nagumo s smile vanishes and he asks whether she is afraid of him  coolly shrugged off his stare  came to ask permission even though she could have acted without it   so nagumo concludes she does not wish to make an enemy of him  refuses to discuss her strategy beyond  i ll leave it at that  plans an attack on ichinose s weak point  raises expulsion as a possible outcome of that attack  declines a student council escort   to fight with the pieces i hold in hand is my modus operandi  wanted to know how far she can take the conflict until it is no longer safe  satisfied she has the right to counterattack after being attacked  raises koenji s private point purchase strategy   pre graduation buying from graduating third years as  a surefire way to graduate from class a    and reasons about the 20 million point rule and spy impracticality with nagumo   ayanokoji  i am somewhat familiar with that name  he s a 1st year  is he not  familiar with the name only  offers to investigate him for nagumo  who refuses  meets kushida outside the student council room  doubts kushida s stated wish to join at a time like this and does not believe she is purely good   fufu  it s exactly that sort of person who d unexpectedly turn villainous though  refuses to take kushida s benevolent reputation at face value    at the very least  sakayanagi doesn t believe that she s purely good","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y1v9-p14-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html#sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y1v9-p14-1\">Student council visit; Kushida outside the door<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.14–25<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Early February after the training camp; Sakayanagi visits second-year president Nagumo in the remade student council room, then meets Kushida Kikyō outside.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> “The student council room has become rather flashy. It’s completely different from the way it used to be.”<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> “Let’s not. I think it would be a problem for there to be two leaders in one organization.”<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> “So you… won’t mind it if she does end up getting expelled?”<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>16 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Voice<\/span> Cool appraisal that reads the room as a symbol of Nagumo’s might rather than a working council chamber.<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Declines Nagumo’s invitation to join while implying equality or superiority to him as a first year; he does not grow angry.<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Goal<\/span> Came to tell Nagumo she will attack student-council member Ichinose Honami-san and that it may get stormy — with information he previously supplied.<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Presses him on permission, expulsion risk, violence policy and the 20-million-point rule; accepts his blind-eye pledge; offers to investigate Ayanokōji when he raises the name.<span class=\"pg\">p.16–24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It’s just in my nature.”<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Stands her ground when Nagumo’s smile vanishes and he asks whether she is afraid of him; coolly shrugged off his stare.<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Tactic<\/span> Came to ask permission even though she could have acted without it — so Nagumo concludes she does not wish to make an enemy of him; refuses to discuss her strategy beyond “I’ll leave it at that.”<span class=\"pg\">p.17–18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Plans an attack on Ichinose’s weak point; raises expulsion as a possible outcome of that attack.<span class=\"pg\">p.16–18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Declines a student-council escort: “To fight with the pieces I hold in hand is my modus operandi.”<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Goal<\/span> Wanted to know how far she can take the conflict until it is no longer safe; satisfied she has the right to counterattack after being attacked.<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> Raises Kōenji’s private-point purchase strategy — pre-graduation buying from graduating third years as “a surefire way to graduate from Class A” — and reasons about the 20-million-point rule and spy impracticality with Nagumo.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Ayanokōji…? I am somewhat familiar with that name. He’s a 1st year, is he not?”<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Familiar with the name only; offers to investigate him for Nagumo, who refuses.<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> Meets Kushida outside the student council room; doubts Kushida’s stated wish to join at a time like this and does not believe she is purely good.<span class=\"pg\">p.24–25<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Fufu. It’s exactly that sort of person who’d unexpectedly turn villainous though.”<span class=\"pg\">p.25<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Refuses to take Kushida’s benevolent reputation at face value — “At the very least, Sakayanagi doesn’t believe that she’s purely good.”<span class=\"pg\">p.25<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y1v9-p33-1\">→ After: Summoning Yamauchi from Class C<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y1v9-p15-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"nagumo-miyabi ryuuen-kakeru","q":"ryuen kakeru named with sakayanagi as an interesting first year after sakayanagi refuses to join the student council  nagumo laughs and names another first year   both you and ryuuen  we ve got a lot of interesting 1st years this year  don t we  narration  like sakayanagi  ryuuen would not think twice about making enemies out of anyone   unlike students who nestle up to the council  ryuuen is not present  only named in nagumo s line and the following narration","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y1v9-p15-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html#sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y1v9-p15-1\">Named with Sakayanagi as an interesting first year<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.15<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">After Sakayanagi refuses to join the student council, Nagumo laughs and names another first year.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> “Both you and Ryuuen. We’ve got a lot of interesting 1st years this year, don’t we?”<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Narration: like Sakayanagi, Ryuuen would not think twice about making enemies out of anyone — unlike students who nestle up to the council.<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ryuuen is not present; only named in Nagumo’s line and the following narration.<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y1v9-p42-1\">→ After: Named as method and possible hidden hand<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p16-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"sakayanagi-arisu nagumo-miyabi ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami target of sakayanagi s planned attack sakayanagi tells nagumo she will launch an attack against student council member ichinose honami san of class b and that it may get stormy  nagumo has heard this before from their previous meeting  sakayanagi is preparing to strike at ichinose s weak point with information nagumo provided  nagumo frames ichinose as his personal property whom he only authorized to be weakened  not expelled  nagumo   honami is my personal property i plan on loving  i only gave you permission to weaken her a bit  sakayanagi raises the possibility that the attack ends in expulsion  nagumo had only permitted bullying  not going that far  ichinose is absent from these pages  the rows record how other characters treat her  not her own speech","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p16-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p16-1\">Target of Sakayanagi’s planned attack<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.16–18, 24<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Position<\/span> Sakayanagi tells Nagumo she will launch an attack against student-council member Ichinose Honami-san of Class B and that it may get stormy; Nagumo has heard this before from their previous meeting.<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Sakayanagi is preparing to strike at Ichinose’s weak point with information Nagumo provided; Nagumo frames Ichinose as his personal property whom he only authorized to be weakened, not expelled.<span class=\"pg\">p.16–18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Nagumo: “Honami is my personal property I plan on loving. I only gave you permission to weaken her a bit.”<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> Sakayanagi raises the possibility that the attack ends in expulsion; Nagumo had only permitted bullying, not going that far.<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ichinose is absent from these pages; the rows record how other characters treat her, not her own speech.<span class=\"pg\">p.16–18<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p6-1\">← Before: Prologue: the criminal letter and the council interview<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p31-1\">→ After: Slandered at a distance<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ishizaki-daichi-y1v9-p19-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"sudou-ken nagumo-miyabi ishizaki-daichi","q":"ishizaki daichi class d class c fight recalled as precedent sakayanagi asks how nagumo would have sentenced the first year fight between class d and class c  named with sudou s group as the parties who quarrelled over surveillance cameras  nagumo says he would suspend the parties involved rather than push them to expulsion  ishizaki is not present  only named in the fight recollection","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ishizaki-daichi-y1v9-p19-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html#sc-ishizaki-daichi-y1v9-p19-1\">Class D–Class C fight recalled as precedent<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.19<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Sakayanagi asks how Nagumo would have sentenced the first-year fight between Class D and Class C.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Named with Sudou’s group as the parties who quarrelled over surveillance cameras.<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Nagumo says he would suspend the parties involved rather than push them to expulsion.<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ishizaki is not present; only named in the fight recollection.<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ishizaki-daichi-y1v9-p56-1\">→ After: Camp group in Ayanokōji’s elimination list<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sudou-ken-y1v9-p19-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"ishizaki-daichi nagumo-miyabi sudou-ken","q":"sudo ken class d class c fight recalled as precedent sakayanagi asks how nagumo would have sentenced the first year fight between class d and class c  named with ishizaki s group as the parties who quarrelled over surveillance cameras  which side punched is left open in the recollection  nagumo says he would suspend the parties involved rather than push them to expulsion   not a harsher sentence than the previous president  sudou is not present  only named in the fight recollection","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sudou-ken-y1v9-p19-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html#sc-sudou-ken-y1v9-p19-1\">Class D–Class C fight recalled as precedent<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.19<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Sakayanagi asks how Nagumo would have sentenced the first-year fight between Class D and Class C.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Named with Ishizaki’s group as the parties who quarrelled over surveillance cameras; which side punched is left open in the recollection.<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Nagumo says he would suspend the parties involved rather than push them to expulsion — not a harsher sentence than the previous president.<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Sudou is not present; only named in the fight recollection.<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sudou-ken-y1v9-p29-1\">→ After: Eavesdropping; absent at the invitation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v9-p20-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"nagumo-miyabi kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke private points strategy named to the council sakayanagi raises a strategy she heard at the training camp  purchasing private points from about to graduate third years  topic came up during koenji and nagumo s conversation at the training camp   only the boys overheard  nagumo treats koenji as holding more points than the school permits   koenji seems to be the only one in possession of an amount greater than what the school permits after all  it s a form of rule violation  his plan exploits that private points are collected at graduation and worthless afterward  announcing it tipped the school off to a loophole that may be closed with a new rule  koenji does not appear in person  rows record how sakayanagi and nagumo discuss his strategy","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v9-p20-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kouenji-rokusuke.html#sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v9-p20-1\">Private-points strategy named to the council<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.20–22<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kouenji-rokusuke.html\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Sakayanagi raises a strategy she heard at the training camp: purchasing private points from about-to-graduate third years.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Topic came up during Kōenji and Nagumo’s conversation at the training camp — only the boys overheard; Nagumo treats Kōenji as holding more points than the school permits.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–21<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> “Kōenji seems to be the only one in possession of an amount greater than what the school permits after all. It’s a form of rule violation.”<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> His plan exploits that private points are collected at graduation and worthless afterward; announcing it tipped the school off to a loophole that may be closed with a new rule.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Kōenji does not appear in person; rows record how Sakayanagi and Nagumo discuss his strategy.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–22<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p24-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"nagumo-miyabi sakayanagi-arisu ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka name raised at the end of the council visit as the sakayanagi nagumo audience ends  nagumo asks about ayanokoji  nagumo raises the name  sakayanagi says she is only somewhat familiar with it  nagumo drops the topic and refuses her offer to investigate   ayanokoji  i am somewhat familiar with that name  he s a 1st year  is he not  ayanokoji does not appear in person  only named in the closing exchange","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p24-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p24-1\">Name raised at the end of the council visit<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.24<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">As the Sakayanagi–Nagumo audience ends, Nagumo asks about Ayanokōji.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> “Ayanokōji…? I am somewhat familiar with that name. He’s a 1st year, is he not?”<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Nagumo raises the name; Sakayanagi says she is only somewhat familiar with it; Nagumo drops the topic and refuses her offer to investigate.<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ayanokōji does not appear in person; only named in the closing exchange.<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p28-1\">→ After: Morning after the breakup; the slander note<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kushida-kikyou-y1v9-p24-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"sakayanagi-arisu kushida-kikyou","q":"kushida kikyo outside the student council room after sakayanagi leaves nagumo s office  she runs into kushida kikyo of class c alone in the corridor   hello  sakayanagi san   yeah  i was thinking i d apply for the student council  could it be you re the same  sakayanagi san  states an intention to apply for the student council at a time when sakayanagi finds the choice doubtful  ends with  see you later  brief corridor exchange  sakayanagi excuses herself and internally doubts the application story  narration only  no bad rumors about her  nothing but benevolent   sakayanagi still does not believe she is purely good  kushida is not present for that thought","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kushida-kikyou-y1v9-p24-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html#sc-kushida-kikyou-y1v9-p24-1\">Outside the student council room<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.24–25<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">After Sakayanagi leaves Nagumo’s office, she runs into Kushida Kikyō of Class C alone in the corridor.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> “Hello, Sakayanagi-san.”<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> &quot;Yeah. I was thinking I&#x27;d apply for the student council. Could it be you&#x27;re the same, Sakayanagi-san?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Position<\/span> States an intention to apply for the student council at a time when Sakayanagi finds the choice doubtful; ends with “See you later~”.<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Brief corridor exchange; Sakayanagi excuses herself and internally doubts the application story.<span class=\"pg\">p.24–25<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Narration only: no bad rumors about her, nothing but benevolent — Sakayanagi still does not believe she is purely good. Kushida is not present for that thought.<span class=\"pg\">p.25<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kushida-kikyou-y1v9-p74-1\">→ After: Named in Ayanokōji’s growth theory<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p28-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"inner spoken","w":"horikita-suzune karuizawa-kei hirata-yousuke ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka morning after the breakup  the slander note early morning class c  karuizawa holds court with the girls  horikita quizzes ayanokoji on who dumped whom as the bell nears   you re rather late to school today  ayanokoji kun   so  which one of them dumped the other  the fake relationship was kei s  if hirata had done the dumping it would mean a problem with kei and could put her status at risk   so hirata likely suggested the public shape that protects her  partner for the morning analysis  she shows him the ichinose slander note and forces the standings notebook onto his desk  observes the breakup s effect on the girls  group  concludes kei can only lose command if someone inside the class truly wins hirata   unlikely  notes hirata boxed in by classmates with no misery  ike and sudo do not tease him   the class has moved past that  there s no doubt sakayanagi is behind the slander campaign  the school cannot trace diffuse word of mouth beyond warning perpetrators   recently  i ve been hearing slander directed at her  treats the four written accusations as defamation in society but weak as a school crime inside the isolated campus  the note s four lines   violence  compensated dating  theft and robbery  drug usage   are written text  not spoken","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p28-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p28-1\">Morning after the breakup; the slander note<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.28–32<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Early morning Class C; Karuizawa holds court with the girls; Horikita quizzes Ayanokōji on who dumped whom as the bell nears.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> “You’re rather late to school today, Ayanokōji-kun.”<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> “So, which one of them dumped the other?”<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> “Recently, I’ve been hearing slander directed at her.”<span class=\"pg\">p.31<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Inner voice<\/span> The fake relationship was Kei’s; if Hirata had done the dumping it would mean a problem with Kei and could put her status at risk — so Hirata likely suggested the public shape that protects her.<span class=\"pg\">p.28–29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Partner for the morning analysis; she shows him the Ichinose slander note and forces the standings notebook onto his desk.<span class=\"pg\">p.28–32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Observes the breakup’s effect on the girls’ group; concludes Kei can only lose command if someone inside the class truly wins Hirata — unlikely.<span class=\"pg\">p.28–29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Notes Hirata boxed in by classmates with no misery; Ike and Sudō do not tease him — the class has moved past that.<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Inner voice<\/span> There’s no doubt Sakayanagi is behind the slander campaign; the school cannot trace diffuse word-of-mouth beyond warning perpetrators.<span class=\"pg\">p.31–32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Treats the four written accusations as defamation in society but weak as a school-crime inside the isolated campus.<span class=\"pg\">p.31<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The note’s four lines — violence, compensated dating, theft and robbery, drug usage — are written text, not spoken.<span class=\"pg\">p.31<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p24-1\">← Before: Name raised at the end of the council visit<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p33-1\">→ After: Watching Sakayanagi and Yamauchi; the cafe study plan<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hirata-yousuke-y1v9-p28-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"karuizawa-kei yamauchi-haruki hasebe-haruka hirata-yousuke","q":"hirata yosuke dumped in public  unmoved class c reacts to the karuizawa hirata breakup  hirata is boxed in by classmates with a gentle expression  the public half of the split  narration  it was a fake relationship kei started  and the face he showed protected her status  not a smidgen of misery  ike and sudo do not tease him   proof the class has outgrown that   it s ok  it s the truth after all  accepts yamauchi s clumsy consolation without displeasure  the best proof he is fine is that the usual teasers stay away  yamauchi alone flippantly congratulates him on getting dumped  ike and sudo flank yamauchi away  cafe  haruka notes many girls in class like him now that he is free  yukimura says a quiet beautiful girl would suit him better than kei  hirata does not speak again in this chapter after the one line  rows record how others treat the news","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hirata-yousuke-y1v9-p28-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html#sc-hirata-yousuke-y1v9-p28-1\">Dumped in public, unmoved<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.28–30, 38<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Class C reacts to the Karuizawa–Hirata breakup; Hirata is boxed in by classmates with a gentle expression.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yamauchi-haruki.html\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> “It’s ok, it’s the truth after all.”<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> The public half of the split; narration: it was a fake relationship Kei started, and the face he showed protected her status.<span class=\"pg\">p.28–29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Position<\/span> Not a smidgen of misery; Ike and Sudō do not tease him — proof the class has outgrown that.<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Voice<\/span> Accepts Yamauchi’s clumsy consolation without displeasure; the best proof he is fine is that the usual teasers stay away.<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/b> Yamauchi alone flippantly congratulates him on getting dumped; Ike and Sudō flank Yamauchi away.<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Cafe: Haruka notes many girls in class like him now that he is free; Yukimura says a quiet beautiful girl would suit him better than Kei.<span class=\"pg\">p.38–39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Hirata does not speak again in this chapter after the one line; rows record how others treat the news.<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hirata-yousuke-y1v9-p56-1\">→ After: Mii-chan’s crush, Ayanokōji’s counsel<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-horikita-suzune-y1v9-p28-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"action spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka yamauchi-haruki ichinose-honami sakayanagi-arisu horikita-suzune","q":"horikita suzune the breakup question  the slander note  blocking yamauchi class c morning after karuizawa and hirata s public split  horikita is ayanokoji s desk neighbour   you re rather late to school today  ayanokoji kun   you seem to be on good terms with hirata kun and karuizawa san  you knew  didn t you   looks like it s karuizawa san who did it  surprised kei dumped hirata   she seemed the type to keep a good man as a symbol of status  her suspicion of ayanokoji fades when he shows nothing  daily desk neighbour analysis partner  she presses the breakup then switches to ichinose s slander  brings up the ichinose slander unprompted and shows a written note rather than speak the accusations   recently  i ve been hearing slander directed at her   it s something i m hesitant to put to words   that s not true  regardless of the veracity  it s defamation it s categorized that way when targeted towards a large number of people  it s possible to sue  frames the campaign as legally defamation in society while conceding the isolated campus blurs crime  wonders whether smoke implies some fire   while calling the chance of full truth extremely low   but i wonder if a tasteless strategy like this will work on ichinose san   even if not all of it s true  perhaps at least one of it is  blocks yamauchi s exit when sakayanagi summons him   the very fact that you re being asked out is abnormal in and of itself   maybe she s trying to do something to knock class c down  warns him and extracts a promise not to let class internal affairs slip  he ignores the warning and leaves  observer stance   approaching ichinose could draw suspicion  she keeps distance while tracking the rumors  names sakayanagi as the likely string puller behind the campaign  narration endorses this  and reads the yamauchi invite as a possible class c attack  forces the training camp standings notebook onto ayanokoji s desk  he flips it but the contents are not re stated on these pages","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y1v9-p28-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html#sc-horikita-suzune-y1v9-p28-1\">The breakup question, the slander note, blocking Yamauchi<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.28–34<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Class C morning after Karuizawa and Hirata’s public split; Horikita is Ayanokōji’s desk neighbour.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yamauchi-haruki.html\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> “You’re rather late to school today, Ayanokōji-kun.”<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> “You seem to be on good terms with Hirata-kun and Karuizawa-san. You knew, didn’t you?”<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> “Looks like it’s Karuizawa-san who did it.”<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>15 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Surprised Kei dumped Hirata — she seemed the type to keep a good man as a symbol of status; her suspicion of Ayanokōji fades when he shows nothing.<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Daily desk-neighbour analysis partner; she presses the breakup then switches to Ichinose’s slander.<span class=\"pg\">p.28–34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Goal<\/span> Brings up the Ichinose slander unprompted and shows a written note rather than speak the accusations.<span class=\"pg\">p.30–31<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Recently, I’ve been hearing slander directed at her.”<span class=\"pg\">p.31<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It’s something I’m hesitant to put to words.”<span class=\"pg\">p.31<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “That’s not true. Regardless of the veracity, it’s defamation…it’s categorized that way when targeted towards a large number of people. It’s possible to sue.”<span class=\"pg\">p.31<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Frames the campaign as legally defamation in society while conceding the isolated campus blurs crime; wonders whether smoke implies some fire — while calling the chance of full truth extremely low.<span class=\"pg\">p.31–32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “But…I wonder if a tasteless strategy like this will work on Ichinose-san.”<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Even if not all of it’s true, perhaps at least one of it is?”<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Blocks Yamauchi’s exit when Sakayanagi summons him: “The very fact that you’re being asked out is abnormal in and of itself.”<span class=\"pg\">p.33–34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Maybe she’s trying to do something to knock Class C down.”<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/b> Warns him and extracts a promise not to let class internal affairs slip; he ignores the warning and leaves.<span class=\"pg\">p.34–35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Observer stance — approaching Ichinose could draw suspicion; she keeps distance while tracking the rumors.<span class=\"pg\">p.31–32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Names Sakayanagi as the likely string-puller behind the campaign (narration endorses this) and reads the Yamauchi invite as a possible Class C attack.<span class=\"pg\">p.32, 34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Forces the training-camp standings notebook onto Ayanokōji’s desk; he flips it but the contents are not re-stated on these pages.<span class=\"pg\">p.33<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y1v9-p68-1\">→ After: Summoning Ichinose; the cold-hearted counsel<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y1v9-p28-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"hirata-yousuke shinohara-satsuki hasebe-haruka karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei public breakup with hirata class c morning  a circle of excited girls surrounds karuizawa after the split becomes public  on the surface the hirata connection is severed  narration allows she could lose command of the girls  group only if someone inside the class truly became hirata s partner   and even then ousting her is hard to imagine   you see  i also thought i needed to step it up  it s easy to be spoiled by yosuke kun but i wanted to think things through on my own  she dumped him  ayanokoji reasons the fake relationship was hers and hirata likely shaped the public story to protect her status  shinohara s loud question about breaking up without a new boyfriend is the class s public reaction  cafe talk  haruka steers back to hirata being free  airi asks whether kei is cute   ayanokoji never paid attention to her  kei is present for the circle but her own lines on p 29 are the only quoted speech  the dumping itself is reported by horikita and narrated  not re enacted on these pages","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y1v9-p28-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y1v9-p28-1\">Public breakup with Hirata<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.28–29, 38–39<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Class C morning: a circle of excited girls surrounds Karuizawa after the split becomes public.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> “You see, I also thought I needed to step it up. It’s easy to be spoiled by Yōsuke-kun but I wanted to think things through on my own.”<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Position<\/span> On the surface the Hirata connection is severed; narration allows she could lose command of the girls’ group only if someone inside the class truly became Hirata’s partner — and even then ousting her is hard to imagine.<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> She dumped him; Ayanokōji reasons the fake relationship was hers and Hirata likely shaped the public story to protect her status.<span class=\"pg\">p.28–29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> Shinohara’s loud question about breaking up without a new boyfriend is the class’s public reaction.<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Cafe talk: Haruka steers back to Hirata being free; Airi asks whether Kei is cute — Ayanokōji never paid attention to her.<span class=\"pg\">p.38–39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Kei is present for the circle but her own lines on p.29 are the only quoted speech; the dumping itself is reported by Horikita and narrated, not re-enacted on these pages.<span class=\"pg\">p.28–29<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y1v9-p56-1\">→ After: The breakup as premise<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ike-kanji-y1v9-p29-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"karuizawa-kei yamauchi-haruki shinohara-satsuki sakayanagi-arisu hasebe-haruka ike-kanji","q":"ike kanji eavesdropping  then the corridor tail class c morning  ike and sudo s group eavesdrop on the karuizawa breakup talk  listens in while chatting  the breakup is public spectacle for the class  flanks yamauchi away from hirata for bad taste teasing  later hurries after him with the rest when sakayanagi calls   this is in bad taste  cut it out  present for shinohara s loud breakup question  mutters in frustration that sakayanagi might be into yamauchi   deduced from her expressions and gestures   could it be that sakayanagi is legit interested in haruki  corridor watch together  haruka rejects his romance read  spots the group in the corridor and redirects them   ahh  stop stop  this way  this way    professor is already there","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ike-kanji-y1v9-p29-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html#sc-ike-kanji-y1v9-p29-1\">Eavesdropping, then the corridor tail<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.29–35<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Class C morning: Ike and Sudō’s group eavesdrop on the Karuizawa breakup talk.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yamauchi-haruki.html\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> “This is in bad taste. Cut it out.”<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> “Could it be that Sakayanagi is legit interested in Haruki?”<span class=\"pg\">p.36<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Listens in while chatting; the breakup is public spectacle for the class.<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/b> Flanks Yamauchi away from Hirata for bad-taste teasing; later hurries after him with the rest when Sakayanagi calls.<span class=\"pg\">p.30–34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> Present for Shinohara’s loud breakup question.<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Mutters in frustration that Sakayanagi might be into Yamauchi — deduced from her expressions and gestures.<span class=\"pg\">p.36<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Corridor watch together; Haruka rejects his romance read.<span class=\"pg\">p.35–36<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Spots the group in the corridor and redirects them: “Ahh, stop stop. This way, this way!” — Professor is already there.<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y1v9-p29-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"karuizawa-kei ike-kanji shinohara-satsuki","q":"shinohara satsuki the loud breakup question class c morning  shinohara voices the class s reaction to karuizawa dumping hirata   ehh  ehh  why did you break up with him even though you don t have a new boyfriend yet  karuizawa san  unrestrained public register   her voice  reverberated  across the room while ike and sudo s group eavesdropped  presses karuizawa directly for the reason behind the split without a new boyfriend lined up  the gossip cell around her includes ike and sudo listening in  only her one line in this chapter  later haruka in the cafe is a different classmate  hasebe  not shinohara","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y1v9-p29-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html#sc-shinohara-satsuki-y1v9-p29-1\">The loud breakup question<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.29<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Class C morning; Shinohara voices the class’s reaction to Karuizawa dumping Hirata.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> “Ehh, ehh? Why did you break up with him even though you don’t have a new boyfriend yet, Karuizawa-san!”<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Voice<\/span> Unrestrained public register — her voice “reverberated” across the room while Ike and Sudō’s group eavesdropped.<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Presses Karuizawa directly for the reason behind the split without a new boyfriend lined up.<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> The gossip cell around her includes Ike and Sudō listening in.<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Only her one line in this chapter; later Haruka in the cafe is a different classmate (Hasebe), not Shinohara.<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sudou-ken-y1v9-p29-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"ike-kanji yamauchi-haruki hirata-yousuke sudou-ken","q":"sudo ken eavesdropping  absent at the invitation class morning gossip about the karuizawa hirata split  group eavesdrops on the girls  together flank yamauchi away from hirata  helps shut down yamauchi s dumping joke    this is in bad taste  cut it out  is ike s line in the exchange  sudo tried to hold yamauchi back first  one of the two who would have teased the dumped boy in earlier days   now they do not  already left for basketball practice when sakayanagi enters  ike notes the rowdier reaction is missing without him  present only in the morning gossip and named as absent at the invitation  no spoken line of sudo s is tagged on these pages","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sudou-ken-y1v9-p29-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html#sc-sudou-ken-y1v9-p29-1\">Eavesdropping; absent at the invitation<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.29–34<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Class morning gossip about the Karuizawa–Hirata split.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yamauchi-haruki.html\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Group eavesdrops on the girls; together flank Yamauchi away from Hirata.<span class=\"pg\">p.29–30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/b> Helps shut down Yamauchi’s dumping joke — “This is in bad taste. Cut it out.” is Ike’s line in the exchange; Sudō tried to hold Yamauchi back first.<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> One of the two who would have teased the dumped boy in earlier days — now they do not.<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Position<\/span> Already left for basketball practice when Sakayanagi enters; Ike notes the rowdier reaction is missing without him.<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Present only in the morning gossip and named as absent at the invitation; no spoken line of Sudō’s is tagged on these pages.<span class=\"pg\">p.29–34<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sudou-ken-y1v9-p19-1\">← Before: Class D–Class C fight recalled as precedent<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-yamauchi-haruki-y1v9-p30-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"hirata-yousuke ike-kanji sudou-ken sakayanagi-arisu horikita-suzune hasebe-haruka yamauchi-haruki","q":"yamauchi haruki dumping jape  then sakayanagi s invitation class c after the hirata karuizawa news  yamauchi alone approaches hirata to console him in bad taste   yo  hirata  heard you got dumped by karuizawa  don t mind it  don t mind it  flippant consolation  ike and sudo flank him away as bad taste  ike and sudo grab him to stop the joke  he refuses to listen  sudo tries to hold him back  yamauchi refutes instead of stopping  sakayanagi walks into class c and names him   is yamauchi haruki kun here  scared at first  then leaves immediately with his bag when she waits in the corridor  she blocks the door and warns him  he ignores her with a toast and street corner romance fantasy   i m going because sakayanagi chan is waiting for me  declares himself the class s lethal weapon and promises to handle anything   i am indeed this class s lethal weapon  but that is exactly why it s okay  on the off chance anything happens  i ll take care of it  no real countermeasure thought through   narration   in all likelihood  he hasn t even given it any thought   don t worry about it  i am well aware of that  the group follows him and sakayanagi  haruka insists the romance is an act  refers to the training camp collision with sakayanagi as the basis for his toast fantasy   that incident is not re shown on these pages","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-yamauchi-haruki-y1v9-p30-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/yamauchi-haruki.html#sc-yamauchi-haruki-y1v9-p30-1\">Dumping jape, then Sakayanagi’s invitation<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.30–35<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/yamauchi-haruki.html\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Class C after the Hirata–Karuizawa news; Yamauchi alone approaches Hirata to console him in bad taste. Sakayanagi walks into Class C and names him: “Is Yamauchi Haruki-kun here?”<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/b> “Yo, Hirata~ Heard you got dumped by Karuizawa~ Don’t mind it, don’t mind it!”<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/b> “I’m going because Sakayanagi-chan is waiting for me.”<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/b> “Don’t worry about it. I am well aware of that.”<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Flippant consolation; Ike and Sudō flank him away as bad taste.<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Ike and Sudō grab him to stop the joke; he refuses to listen.<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Sudō tries to hold him back; Yamauchi refutes instead of stopping.<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Scared at first, then leaves immediately with his bag when she waits in the corridor.<span class=\"pg\">p.33–35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She blocks the door and warns him; he ignores her with a toast-and-street-corner romance fantasy.<span class=\"pg\">p.34–35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Declares himself the class’s lethal weapon and promises to handle anything: “I am indeed this class’s lethal weapon. But that is exactly why it’s okay. On the off chance anything happens, I’ll take care of it.”<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> No real countermeasure thought through — narration: “In all likelihood, he hasn’t even given it any thought.”<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> The group follows him and Sakayanagi; Haruka insists the romance is an act.<span class=\"pg\">p.35–37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Refers to the training-camp collision with Sakayanagi as the basis for his toast fantasy — that incident is not re-shown on these pages.<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p31-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"sakayanagi-arisu horikita-suzune kanzaki-ryuuji hashimoto-masayoshi ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami slandered at a distance horikita shows ayanokoji the written accusations against ichinose  later the class spots her in the cafe area and kanzaki confronts hashimoto about the campaign  four written lines   a history of violence   engaged in compensated dating   engaged in theft and robbery   a noted history of drug usage  narration   there s no doubt it s sakayanagi pulling the strings behind the scenes  horikita tracks the slander from afar and wonders whether smoke implies some fire   while calling full truth extremely unlikely  seen with stiff faced class b classmates who appear to protect her  she chats cheerfully as usual  kanzaki is absent from her side  his absence beside her is noticed  he is in the gym defending her name instead  hashimoto quotes her reply to kanzaki and argues a good present does not prove a good past  she told kanzaki not to take the rumors to heart   neither affirmed nor denied them  not seeking help or a culprit hunt  kanzaki says she hates extreme conflicts and would forgive defamers  ichinose has no spoken line in this chapter  every row is how others write and argue about her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p31-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p31-1\">Slandered at a distance<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.31–32, 40–41, 47–50<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Horikita shows Ayanokōji the written accusations against Ichinose; later the class spots her in the cafe area and Kanzaki confronts Hashimoto about the campaign.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Position<\/span> Four written lines: “‘A history of violence’”, “‘Engaged in compensated dating’”, “‘Engaged in theft and robbery’”, “‘A noted history of drug usage’”.<span class=\"pg\">p.31<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Narration: “There’s no doubt it’s Sakayanagi pulling the strings behind the scenes.”<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Horikita tracks the slander from afar and wonders whether smoke implies some fire — while calling full truth extremely unlikely.<span class=\"pg\">p.31–32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Position<\/span> Seen with stiff-faced Class B classmates who appear to protect her; she chats cheerfully as usual; Kanzaki is absent from her side.<span class=\"pg\">p.40<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> His absence beside her is noticed; he is in the gym defending her name instead.<span class=\"pg\">p.40, 47–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Hashimoto quotes her reply to Kanzaki and argues a good present does not prove a good past.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> She told Kanzaki not to take the rumors to heart — neither affirmed nor denied them.<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> Not seeking help or a culprit hunt; Kanzaki says she hates extreme conflicts and would forgive defamers.<span class=\"pg\">p.50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ichinose has no spoken line in this chapter; every row is how others write and argue about her.<span class=\"pg\">p.31, 40, 47–50<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p16-1\">← Before: Target of Sakayanagi’s planned attack<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p53-1\">→ After: Alone, then the three-way meeting<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p33-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"inner spoken","w":"yamauchi-haruki sakayanagi-arisu hasebe-haruka yukimura-teruhiko sakura-airi miyake-akito ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka watching sakayanagi and yamauchi  the cafe study plan sakayanagi enters class c and names yamauchi  the ayanokoji group follows to the corridor and cafe  horikita blocks yamauchi s exit  ayanokoji stands aside   yamauchi does not heed the warning  analyzes sakayanagi s hair touching as a deliberate image rather than genuine interest  while allowing that boldness makes either possible   yamauchi and sakayanagi haven t interacted until now  it s too abrupt  isn t it too much to call it romance  cafe conversation led by haruka  he gives the rational counter that romance needs a foundation  yukimura sets the study plan   start after the practice test on the 15th  ayanokoji agrees the exam will be written  chabashira gave no special explanation for the end of year exam  so a failing grade means expulsion as usual  airi asks whether karuizawa is cute  he answers he never paid attention to her  takes miyake s club time call about the class a b quarrel  haruka proposes going to find him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p33-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p33-1\">Watching Sakayanagi and Yamauchi; the cafe study plan<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.33–42<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Sakayanagi enters Class C and names Yamauchi; the Ayanokōji Group follows to the corridor and cafe.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/yamauchi-haruki.html\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakura-airi.html\">Sakura Airi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> “Yamauchi and Sakayanagi haven’t interacted until now, it’s too abrupt. Isn’t it too much to call it romance?”<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q inner\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Chabashira gave no special explanation for the end-of-year exam, so a failing grade means expulsion as usual.<span class=\"pg\">p.39<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/b> Horikita blocks Yamauchi’s exit; Ayanokōji stands aside — Yamauchi does not heed the warning.<span class=\"pg\">p.34–37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Analyzes Sakayanagi’s hair-touching as a deliberate image rather than genuine interest, while allowing that boldness makes either possible.<span class=\"pg\">p.35–37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Cafe conversation led by Haruka; he gives the rational counter that romance needs a foundation.<span class=\"pg\">p.36–38<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Yukimura sets the study plan — start after the practice test on the 15th; Ayanokōji agrees the exam will be written.<span class=\"pg\">p.38–40<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakura Airi<\/b> Airi asks whether Karuizawa is cute; he answers he never paid attention to her.<span class=\"pg\">p.38–39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> Takes Miyake’s club-time call about the Class A–B quarrel; Haruka proposes going to find him.<span class=\"pg\">p.41–42<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p28-1\">← Before: Morning after the breakup; the slander note<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p43-1\">→ After: Gymnasium: Hashimoto against Kanzaki<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y1v9-p33-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"action spoken","w":"yamauchi-haruki horikita-suzune hasebe-haruka sakayanagi-arisu","q":"sakayanagi arisu summoning yamauchi from class c near end of school  sakayanagi enters class c unannounced and asks for yamauchi by name   would you mind giving me a few moments of your time   this isn t quite the right place so i ll be waiting for you in the corridor by the stairs  leaves with downcast eyes under the class s stares  yamauchi follows instantly  invites him out  plays hair and shy gestures that haruka reads as deliberate act  walks side by side at his matched slow pace   the truth is  i ve been wanting to talk to you for a while now  yamauchi kun   i don t have time to lie about something like this  you know   i won t be able to calm down here  shall we go elsewhere   in that case  please accompany me for a while  horikita reads the public invite as a possible move to knock class c down   sakayanagi does not appear to respond to that warning on these pages  the watching group concludes she is acting  not romancing  her purpose with yamauchi is not stated on these pages  only the invitation and departure are shown","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y1v9-p33-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html#sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y1v9-p33-1\">Summoning Yamauchi from Class C<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.33–37<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Near end of school, Sakayanagi enters Class C unannounced and asks for Yamauchi by name.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/yamauchi-haruki.html\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> “Would you mind giving me a few moments of your time?”<span class=\"pg\">p.33<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> “…This isn’t quite the right place so I’ll be waiting for you in the corridor by the stairs.”<span class=\"pg\">p.33<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> “The truth is, I’ve been wanting to talk to you for a while now, Yamauchi-kun.”<span class=\"pg\">p.37<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Leaves with downcast eyes under the class’s stares; Yamauchi follows instantly.<span class=\"pg\">p.33–34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/b> Invites him out; plays hair and shy gestures that Haruka reads as deliberate act; walks side-by-side at his matched slow pace.<span class=\"pg\">p.33–37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I don’t have time to lie about something like this, you know?”<span class=\"pg\">p.37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I won’t be able to calm down here, shall we go elsewhere?”<span class=\"pg\">p.37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “In that case, please accompany me for a while.”<span class=\"pg\">p.37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Horikita reads the public invite as a possible move to knock Class C down — Sakayanagi does not appear to respond to that warning on these pages.<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> The watching group concludes she is acting, not romancing.<span class=\"pg\">p.36–38<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Her purpose with Yamauchi is not stated on these pages; only the invitation and departure are shown.<span class=\"pg\">p.33–37<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y1v9-p14-1\">← Before: Student council visit; Kushida outside the door<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y1v9-p56-1\">→ After: Named as the rumor source<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hasebe-haruka-y1v9-p35-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"yamauchi-haruki sakayanagi-arisu sotomura-hideo ayanokouji-kiyotaka miyake-akito ichinose-honami hasebe-haruka","q":"hasebe haruka corridor watch and the cafe corridor outside class c after yamauchi leaves with sakayanagi  haruka gathers the ayanokoji group to watch  then the cafe  leads the tail after yamauchi   no  no  this is way too stupid  she s super cunning  there s absolutely no way she s actually into yamauchi kun  reads the hair touch and shy manner as deliberate performance for the boys  benefit    she s definitely acting  notices the professor no longer uses  gozaru  in his speech  loses interest when ayanokoji explains the training camp fix  cafe partner  asks him and yukimura whether romance is possible  accepts his rational counter  then steers to hirata s new freedom   kiyopon and yukimu  what do you think  do you really think romance is a possibility   ahh  speaking of hirata kun  he broke up with karuizawa san  right   quite a lot of girls in our class like hirata kun  i wonder what s going to happen  takes his speakerphone call about the class a b quarrel and proposes the group go find him  teases that airi would be saved by kiyopon   hmm  could it be overtime club practice  looks at ichinose coldly  frames the slander as the burden popular girls bear  says miyache used to be bad himself   her read of why he is not afraid of ryuuen s class","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hasebe-haruka-y1v9-p35-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html#sc-hasebe-haruka-y1v9-p35-1\">Corridor watch and the cafe<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.35–42<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Corridor outside Class C after Yamauchi leaves with Sakayanagi; Haruka gathers the Ayanokōji Group to watch, then the cafe.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/yamauchi-haruki.html\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sotomura-hideo.html\">Sotomura Hideo<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> “No, no, this is way too stupid. She’s super cunning. There’s absolutely no way she’s actually into Yamauchi-kun.”<span class=\"pg\">p.36<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> “Kiyopon and Yukimu~, what do you think? Do you really think romance is a possibility?”<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> “Ahh, speaking of Hirata-kun… He broke up with Karuizawa-san, right?”<span class=\"pg\">p.39<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/b> Leads the tail after Yamauchi.<span class=\"pg\">p.35–37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Reads the hair-touch and shy manner as deliberate performance for the boys’ benefit — “She’s definitely acting.”<span class=\"pg\">p.36–38<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sotomura Hideo<\/b> Notices the Professor no longer uses ’gozaru’ in his speech; loses interest when Ayanokōji explains the training-camp fix.<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Cafe partner; asks him and Yukimura whether romance is possible, accepts his rational counter, then steers to Hirata’s new freedom.<span class=\"pg\">p.36–42<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Quite a lot of girls in our class like Hirata-kun. I wonder what’s going to happen.”<span class=\"pg\">p.39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> Takes his speakerphone call about the Class A–B quarrel and proposes the group go find him; teases that Airi would be saved by Kiyopon.<span class=\"pg\">p.41–42<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Hmm? Could it be overtime club practice?”<span class=\"pg\">p.41<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Looks at Ichinose coldly; frames the slander as the burden popular girls bear.<span class=\"pg\">p.40–41<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Says Miyache used to be bad himself — her read of why he is not afraid of Ryuuen’s class.<span class=\"pg\">p.42<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hasebe-haruka-y1v9-p51-1\">→ After: Gym farewell and the delinquent talk<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sotomura-hideo-y1v9-p35-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"hasebe-haruka ayanokouji-kiyotaka sotomura-hideo","q":"sotomura hideo the professor s new speech corridor outside class c  the group pauses to watch yamauchi and sakayanagi  no longer uses  gozaru  as part of his speech   haruka notices and loses interest when ayanokoji explains he was set straight during the training camp  haruka flags the lost individuality  ayanokoji supplies the training camp explanation  explains the serious tone to haruka  named only as  the professor  on this page  roster alias professor   the professor  sotomura not printed in year 1  vol  9 so far","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sotomura-hideo-y1v9-p35-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sotomura-hideo.html#sc-sotomura-hideo-y1v9-p35-1\">The Professor’s new speech<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.35<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sotomura-hideo.html\">Sotomura Hideo<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Corridor outside Class C; the group pauses to watch Yamauchi and Sakayanagi.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> No longer uses ’gozaru’ as part of his speech — Haruka notices and loses interest when Ayanokōji explains he was set straight during the training camp.<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Haruka flags the lost individuality; Ayanokōji supplies the training-camp explanation.<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Explains the serious tone to Haruka.<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Named only as “the Professor” on this page; roster alias Professor / The Professor; Sotomura not printed in Year 1, Vol. 9 so far.<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sakura-airi-y1v9-p36-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"hasebe-haruka ayanokouji-kiyotaka hirata-yousuke miyake-akito ichinose-honami sakura-airi","q":"sakura airi cafe blush and the walk to miyake cafe with the ayanokoji group  airi agrees the sakayanagi approach looked sly  backs haruka s  definitely acting  line  teased along on the walk to find miyake   i  i think that was  umm  that   yeah  her gestures looked that way but  like keisei kun said  maybe she s trying to investigate class c so she can do something bad  asks whether karuizawa is cute and wants to hear his answer  accepts his reply that he never really paid attention to karuizawa   karuizawa san is also cute  don t you think so  kiyotaka kun  group speculation that many girls like hirata now that he is free  shrinks at the idea of visiting the quarrel  haruka teases that kiyopon will save her if she is in a pinch   b but wouldn t that be dangerous  puzzled by the slander    really    as if she cannot imagine popular girl targets  her perplexity at the burden of popularity line marks her distance from the social games around ichinose","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sakura-airi-y1v9-p36-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sakura-airi.html#sc-sakura-airi-y1v9-p36-1\">Cafe blush and the walk to Miyake<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.36–42<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sakura-airi.html\">Sakura Airi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Cafe with the Ayanokōji Group; Airi agrees the Sakayanagi approach looked sly.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakura Airi<\/b> “I… I think that was, umm, that…”<span class=\"pg\">p.37<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakura Airi<\/b> “Yeah, her gestures looked that way but… like Keisei-kun said, maybe she’s trying to investigate Class C so she can do something bad.”<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sakura Airi<\/b> “Karuizawa-san is also cute… Don’t you think so, Kiyotaka-kun?”<span class=\"pg\">p.39<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Backs Haruka’s “definitely acting” line; teased along on the walk to find Miyake.<span class=\"pg\">p.36–42<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Asks whether Karuizawa is cute and wants to hear his answer; accepts his reply that he never really paid attention to Karuizawa.<span class=\"pg\">p.38–39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Group speculation that many girls like Hirata now that he is free.<span class=\"pg\">p.38–39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> Shrinks at the idea of visiting the quarrel; Haruka teases that Kiyopon will save her if she is in a pinch.<span class=\"pg\">p.41–42<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “B-But wouldn’t that be dangerous?”<span class=\"pg\">p.42<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Puzzled by the slander — “Really?” — as if she cannot imagine popular-girl targets.<span class=\"pg\">p.41<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Her perplexity at the burden-of-popularity line marks her distance from the social games around Ichinose.<span class=\"pg\">p.41–42<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sakura-airi-y1v9-p51-1\">→ After: At the gym dispersal<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y1v9-p36-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"hasebe-haruka sakayanagi-arisu yukimura-teruhiko","q":"yukimura teruhiko cafe  romance refused  exam plan set ayanokoji group cafe after watching sakayanagi and yamauchi  yukimura  keisei  is present with haruka and airi  asked twice whether the sakayanagi yamauchi thing is romance  refuses the topic and turns to study   can we really call it a farce though   i m not very well versed in that area  please don t ask me that so many times  allows that she may be investigating class c but says secret contact would suit that goal better than a public invite  sets the end of year study plan   start after the practice test on the 15th  about ten days on past problems and trends  pushes realism when haruka and airi reminisce   i ll study   if a student gets a failing grade  they ll be expelled immediately  that s probably how it ll be   if you flunk the end of school year exam  it s expulsion for you  and it still depends on the contents of the special exam  after he starts studying  haruka notices ichinose across the room  called  keisei  and  yukimu  on these pages  roster id yukimura teruhiko per standing decision","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y1v9-p36-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html#sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y1v9-p36-1\">Cafe: romance refused, exam plan set<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.36–40<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ayanokōji Group cafe after watching Sakayanagi and Yamauchi; Yukimura (“Keisei”) is present with Haruka and Airi.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> “Can we really call it a farce though?”<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> “I’m not very well-versed in that area. Please don’t ask me that so many times.”<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> “I’ll study.”<span class=\"pg\">p.39<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Asked twice whether the Sakayanagi–Yamauchi thing is romance; refuses the topic and turns to study.<span class=\"pg\">p.36–39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Allows that she may be investigating Class C but says secret contact would suit that goal better than a public invite.<span class=\"pg\">p.36–37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Goal<\/span> Sets the end-of-year study plan — start after the practice test on the 15th, about ten days on past problems and trends; pushes realism when Haruka and Airi reminisce.<span class=\"pg\">p.39–40<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “If a student gets a failing grade, they’ll be expelled immediately. That’s probably how it’ll be.”<span class=\"pg\">p.39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “If you flunk the end of school year exam, it’s expulsion for you. And it still depends on the contents of the special exam.”<span class=\"pg\">p.40<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> After he starts studying, Haruka notices Ichinose across the room.<span class=\"pg\">p.40<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Called “Keisei” and “Yukimu~” on these pages; roster id yukimura-teruhiko per standing decision.<span class=\"pg\">p.38–40<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y1v9-p52-1\">→ After: “Yukimuu” in the dorm-path talk<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-chabashira-sae-y1v9-p39-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"yukimura-teruhiko chabashira-sae","q":"chabashira sae named as the exam s silent teacher cafe study talk  yukimura plans around the end of year exam  narration  chabashira gave no special explanation for the end of year exam  so it will be written as usual and a failing grade means expulsion  homeroom instructor whose silence is read as  written exam as usual  chabashira does not appear  only named as the source of the  non briefing","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-chabashira-sae-y1v9-p39-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html#sc-chabashira-sae-y1v9-p39-1\">Named as the exam’s silent teacher<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.39–40<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Cafe study talk; Yukimura plans around the end-of-year exam.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Narration: Chabashira gave no special explanation for the end-of-year exam, so it will be written as usual and a failing grade means expulsion.<span class=\"pg\">p.39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Post<\/span> Homeroom instructor whose silence is read as “written exam as usual.”<span class=\"pg\">p.39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Chabashira does not appear; only named as the source of the (non-)briefing.<span class=\"pg\">p.39–40<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-miyake-akito-y1v9-p41-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"hasebe-haruka ryuuen-kakeru hashimoto-masayoshi kanzaki-ryuuji ayanokouji-kiyotaka miyake-akito","q":"miyake akito club call and gymnasium standoff phone call on speaker from club duty  later standing watch between hashimoto and kanzaki in the gym   no  looks like trouble s brewing   class a and class b are quarreling  worst case scenario  i have to be there to stop them if a fight breaks out  answers haruka s call  ends it after saying the trouble could reach their class next  narration  his willingness to deal with ryuuen in the training camp and the old  bad himself  story explain his confidence  stands between the two first years  hashimoto tries to drag him into the argument  he stays until sure they will not fistfight   you re quite persistent  miyake  i wasn t the one who instigated this in the first place  kanzaki was  kanzaki wanted no audience  miyake refuses to leave until the de escalation is clear  asks ayanokoji what the group should do  accepts the stay and watch advice   hey  what should we do  physical barrier between two confrontational classmates without taking a side   his standing role in the scene  club activity not named on these pages beyond  done with club activities    archery is implied by the search path  not stated as his club in the quoted lines","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-miyake-akito-y1v9-p41-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html#sc-miyake-akito-y1v9-p41-1\">Club call and gymnasium standoff<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.41–46<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Phone call on speaker from club duty; later standing watch between Hashimoto and Kanzaki in the gym.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> “No… Looks like trouble’s brewing.”<span class=\"pg\">p.41<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> “Class A and Class B are quarreling. Worst case scenario, I have to be there to stop them if a fight breaks out.”<span class=\"pg\">p.41<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> “You’re quite persistent, Miyake. I wasn’t the one who instigated this in the first place, Kanzaki was.”<span class=\"pg\">p.43<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Answers Haruka’s call; ends it after saying the trouble could reach their class next.<span class=\"pg\">p.41–42<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Narration: his willingness to deal with Ryuuen in the training camp and the old “bad himself” story explain his confidence.<span class=\"pg\">p.42<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Stands between the two first-years; Hashimoto tries to drag him into the argument; he stays until sure they will not fistfight.<span class=\"pg\">p.43–46<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Kanzaki wanted no audience; Miyake refuses to leave until the de-escalation is clear.<span class=\"pg\">p.43–46<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Asks Ayanokōji what the group should do; accepts the stay-and-watch advice.<span class=\"pg\">p.46<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Hey, what should we do?”<span class=\"pg\">p.46<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Physical barrier between two confrontational classmates without taking a side — his standing role in the scene.<span class=\"pg\">p.43<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Club activity not named on these pages beyond “done with club activities?” — archery is implied by the search path, not stated as his club in the quoted lines.<span class=\"pg\">p.41<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-miyake-akito-y1v9-p51-1\">→ After: Delinquent history and Ryuuen’s neighbourhood<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y1v9-p42-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"miyake-akito hashimoto-masayoshi kanzaki-ryuuji ryuuen-kakeru","q":"ryuen kakeru named as method and possible hidden hand class a b quarrel path  ryuuen s class is the standing  trouble  reference  hashimoto invokes him in the gym  narration  miyake s willingness to handle ryuuen in the training camp reads as confidence in his own skills   maybe it s the handiwork of ryuuen and he s actually just pretending to have retired    deflection floated to kanzaki  kanzaki says class a s malice is no different from what ryuuen would do   it s usually always that class stirring up trouble    the group s default suspect is ryuuen s now class d set  ryuuen is not present  only named in talk about the quarrel and the rumor source","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y1v9-p42-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html#sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y1v9-p42-1\">Named as method and possible hidden hand<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.42, 45, 49<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Class A–B quarrel path; Ryuuen’s class is the standing “trouble” reference; Hashimoto invokes him in the gym.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> Narration: Miyake’s willingness to handle Ryuuen in the training camp reads as confidence in his own skills.<span class=\"pg\">p.42<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> “Maybe it’s the handiwork of Ryuuen and he’s actually just pretending to have retired?” — deflection floated to Kanzaki.<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Kanzaki says Class A’s malice is no different from what Ryuuen would do.<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> “It’s usually always that class stirring up trouble” — the group’s default suspect is Ryuuen’s now-Class D set.<span class=\"pg\">p.42<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ryuuen is not present; only named in talk about the quarrel and the rumor source.<span class=\"pg\">p.42, 45, 49<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y1v9-p15-1\">← Before: Named with Sakayanagi as an interesting first year<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y1v9-p52-1\">→ After: Middle-school neighbour and camp group<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p43-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"inner","w":"hashimoto-masayoshi kanzaki-ryuuji miyake-akito ichinose-honami ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka gymnasium  hashimoto against kanzaki gymnasium off the school building   hashimoto and kanzaki face off with miyake standing between them  the ayanokoji group arrives  watches hashimoto evade and eventually admit spreading rumors without claiming origin  concludes from his manner that the rumors aren t all lies  kanzaki asks his input  he advises staying until told to leave   a third party can keep a fight civil   isn t it fine until they tell us to leave  if at some point  this turns into a fight  the presence of a third party can help keep things civil  miyake called them over  ayanokoji stays as observer at his side  concludes from hashimoto s speech that the circulating rumors about ichinose  aren t all lies  notes defamation libel grounds if truth does not conflict with public interest  temporarily sets aside his position as a student and reads the situation from society s point of view   ichinose could sue regardless of truth where reputation damage is shown  quoted from hashimoto  ichinose s reply to kanzaki was neither affirmation nor denial of the rumors","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p43-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p43-1\">Gymnasium: Hashimoto against Kanzaki<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.43–50<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Gymnasium off the school building — Hashimoto and Kanzaki face off with Miyake standing between them; the Ayanokōji Group arrives.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q inner\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Temporarily sets aside his position as a student and reads the situation from society’s point of view — Ichinose could sue regardless of truth where reputation damage is shown.<span class=\"pg\">p.50<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Watches Hashimoto evade and eventually admit spreading rumors without claiming origin; concludes from his manner that the rumors aren’t all lies.<span class=\"pg\">p.43–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Kanzaki asks his input; he advises staying until told to leave — a third party can keep a fight civil.<span class=\"pg\">p.44–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> “Isn’t it fine until they tell us to leave? If at some point, this turns into a fight, the presence of a third party can help keep things civil.”<span class=\"pg\">p.46<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> Miyake called them over; Ayanokōji stays as observer at his side.<span class=\"pg\">p.43–46<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Concludes from Hashimoto’s speech that the circulating rumors about Ichinose “aren’t all lies”; notes defamation/libel grounds if truth does not conflict with public interest.<span class=\"pg\">p.50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Quoted from Hashimoto: Ichinose’s reply to Kanzaki was neither affirmation nor denial of the rumors.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–48<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p33-1\">← Before: Watching Sakayanagi and Yamauchi; the cafe study plan<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p51-1\">→ After: Gym exit, tail, and Mii-chan’s interception<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y1v9-p43-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"action spoken","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji ichinose-honami katsuragi-kouhei ryuuen-kakeru sakayanagi-arisu hashimoto-masayoshi","q":"hashimoto masayoshi gymnasium  accused of spreading the ichinose rumors gymnasium   hashimoto faces kanzaki with miyake between them and the ayanokoji group arriving  target of kanzaki s all day tail and questioning  eventually admits helping rumors along   you guys aren t really going to fight  are you    opening deflection when the group arrives  earlier   you re quite persistent  miyake   rumors  ah  you mean the ones about ichinose doing various malicious things  what connection do i have with those rumors   playing dumb is just a waste of everyone s time    kanzaki s charge  hashimoto answers evasively   you can t have smoke without a fire  that s probably what most students are thinking  presses that ichinose neither affirmed nor denied the rumors  quotes her reply to kanzaki  argues a good person now need not have been good in the past   she said something like   i hope you aren t entranced by any of those rumors  don t take them to heart  contempt for kanzaki s blind faith    oh give it up kanzaki  responses like that stink so much that i can t even look you in the eyes   then i ll tell you  i ve been spreading around rumors about ichinose    admits passing rumors along while denying origin   in other words  you have no intention of retracting those rumors    kanzaki s read  hashimoto says rumors cannot be taken back   these last few days  i ve been doing a thorough investigation on you guys in class a    kanzaki s counter  hashimoto floats ryuuen as alternative   maybe it s the handiwork of ryuuen and he s actually just pretending to have retired  named as the other class a figure who could order class a students  after sakayanagi  invokes ryuuen as a possible hidden hand to deflect kanzaki  denies instruction from sakayanagi while not denying class a involvement  ayanokoji s read  from how hashimoto speaks and acts  the rumors  aren t all lies  never names the original source  only admits helping pass rumors along","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y1v9-p43-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html#sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y1v9-p43-1\">Gymnasium: accused of spreading the Ichinose rumors<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.43–50<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Gymnasium — Hashimoto faces Kanzaki with Miyake between them and the Ayanokōji Group arriving.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> “You guys aren’t really going to fight, are you?” — opening deflection when the group arrives; earlier: “You’re quite persistent, Miyake.”<span class=\"pg\">p.43<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> “Rumors? Ah, you mean the ones about Ichinose doing various malicious things? What connection do I have with those rumors?”<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> “Playing dumb is just a waste of everyone’s time.” — Kanzaki’s charge; Hashimoto answers evasively.<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>14 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Target of Kanzaki’s all-day tail and questioning; eventually admits helping rumors along.<span class=\"pg\">p.43–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You can’t have smoke without a fire. That’s probably what most students are thinking.”<span class=\"pg\">p.46<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Presses that Ichinose neither affirmed nor denied the rumors; quotes her reply to Kanzaki; argues a good person now need not have been good in the past.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “She said something like: ‘I hope you aren’t entranced by any of those rumors. Don’t take them to heart.’”<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Contempt for Kanzaki’s blind faith — “Oh give it up Kanzaki. Responses like that stink so much that I can’t even look you in the eyes.”<span class=\"pg\">p.47–48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> “Then I’ll tell you. I’ve been spreading around rumors about Ichinose.” — admits passing rumors along while denying origin.<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “In other words, you have no intention of retracting those rumors.” — Kanzaki’s read; Hashimoto says rumors cannot be taken back.<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “These last few days, I’ve been doing a thorough investigation on you guys in Class A.” — Kanzaki’s counter; Hashimoto floats Ryuuen as alternative.<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Maybe it’s the handiwork of Ryuuen and he’s actually just pretending to have retired?”<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> Named as the other Class A figure who could order Class A students, after Sakayanagi.<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Invokes Ryuuen as a possible hidden hand to deflect Kanzaki.<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Denies instruction from Sakayanagi while not denying Class A involvement.<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> Ayanokōji’s read: from how Hashimoto speaks and acts, the rumors “aren’t all lies.”<span class=\"pg\">p.50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Never names the original source; only admits helping pass rumors along.<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y1v9-p51-1\">→ After: Leaving the gym; the dorm tail<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p43-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"hashimoto-masayoshi ichinose-honami sakayanagi-arisu katsuragi-kouhei ryuuen-kakeru miyake-akito hasebe-haruka kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji gymnasium  tracing the rumors to class a gymnasium   kanzaki  class b  confronts hashimoto  class a  with miyake standing between them  tails him all day  then presses the rumor source  hashimoto admits spreading but not originating   continuing from where we left off  hashimoto  what have you been doing after school  you don t belong to any clubs  so why are you here so late   you re not waiting here in order to meet anyone in particular  you re just trying to spread rumors to as many people as you can  aren t you   playing dumb is just a waste of everyone s time  i want to make one thing crystal clear with you  what you and the rest of your class are doing is simply too malicious  it s no different than the type of thing ryuuen would do   rumors can create smoke without a fire as long as there s malicious intent  has asked ichinose directly  believes her after about a year of going through thick and thin with class b   approximately one year  that s how long i ve been going through thick and thin together with class b  that s why i m absolutely certain   in other words  you have no intention of retracting those rumors   these last few days  i ve been doing a thorough investigation on you guys in class a  investigation covers first  second  and third year students who heard the rumors from class a  vague deflections match hashimoto s own   the rumors about ichinose were almost certainly propagated by your class a   was it sakayanagi who gave you instructions to spread the rumors   then who did  she s the only one who can give instructions to you guys in class a other than katsuragi  names her as the only class a superior besides katsuragi who could order the campaign  the other named class a authority in his chain of command question  compares class a s malice to ryuuen s methods  hashimoto counters that ryuuen may be feigning retirement  miyake stands watch between them  kanzaki is troubled by extra arrivals   he wanted to speak alone  group witnesses  hashimoto turns the gossip about girls line toward haruka and airi   ichinose hates extreme conflicts  i m sure that she has a big enough heart to even forgive the people who are defaming her  absolute trust in ichinose under pressure  refuses to doubt her even when she neither confirms nor denies","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p43-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html#sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p43-1\">Gymnasium: tracing the rumors to Class A<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.43–50<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Gymnasium — Kanzaki (Class B) confronts Hashimoto (Class A) with Miyake standing between them.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a> <span class=\"n\">+1 more<\/span><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> “Continuing from where we left off, Hashimoto. What have you been doing after school? You don’t belong to any clubs, so why are you here so late?”<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> “You’re not waiting here in order to meet anyone in particular. You’re just trying to spread rumors to as many people as you can, aren’t you?”<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> “Playing dumb is just a waste of everyone’s time. I want to make one thing crystal clear with you. What you and the rest of your class are doing is simply too malicious. It’s no different than the type of thing Ryuuen would do.”<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>17 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Tails him all day, then presses the rumor source; Hashimoto admits spreading but not originating.<span class=\"pg\">p.43–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> “Rumors can create smoke without a fire as long as there’s malicious intent.”<span class=\"pg\">p.46<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Has asked Ichinose directly; believes her after about a year of going through thick and thin with Class B.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Approximately one year. That’s how long I’ve been going through thick and thin together with Class B. That’s why I’m absolutely certain.”<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “In other words, you have no intention of retracting those rumors.”<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “These last few days, I’ve been doing a thorough investigation on you guys in Class A.”<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Investigation covers first-, second- and third-year students who heard the rumors from Class A; vague deflections match Hashimoto’s own.<span class=\"pg\">p.48–49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “The rumors about Ichinose were almost certainly propagated by your Class A.”<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Was it Sakayanagi who gave you instructions to spread the rumors?”<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Then who did? She’s the only one who can give instructions to you guys in Class A other than Katsuragi.”<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Names her as the only Class A superior besides Katsuragi who could order the campaign.<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> The other named Class A authority in his chain-of-command question.<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Compares Class A’s malice to Ryuuen’s methods; Hashimoto counters that Ryuuen may be feigning retirement.<span class=\"pg\">p.45, 49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> Miyake stands watch between them; Kanzaki is troubled by extra arrivals — he wanted to speak alone.<span class=\"pg\">p.43–44<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Group witnesses; Hashimoto turns the gossip-about-girls line toward Haruka and Airi.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Ichinose hates extreme conflicts. I’m sure that she has a big enough heart to even forgive the people who are defaming her.”<span class=\"pg\">p.50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Absolute trust in Ichinose under pressure; refuses to doubt her even when she neither confirms nor denies.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–50<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p51-1\">→ After: Bowing out; reported to Ichinose<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y1v9-p49-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"hashimoto-masayoshi kanzaki-ryuuji katsuragi-kouhei","q":"katsuragi kohei named as the other class a authority gymnasium questioning  kanzaki names who could order class a students  hashimoto is asked whether sakayanagi instructed him  kanzaki adds katsuragi as the only other class a figure who could   then who did  she s the only one who can give instructions to you guys in class a other than katsuragi  katsuragi does not appear  only named in kanzaki s chain of command question","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y1v9-p49-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html#sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y1v9-p49-1\">Named as the other Class A authority<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.49<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Gymnasium questioning; Kanzaki names who could order Class A students.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> “Then who did? She’s the only one who can give instructions to you guys in Class A other than Katsuragi.”<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Hashimoto is asked whether Sakayanagi instructed him; Kanzaki adds Katsuragi as the only other Class A figure who could.<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Katsuragi does not appear; only named in Kanzaki’s chain-of-command question.<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y1v9-p70-1\">→ After: Sakayanagi’s Class A pattern recalled<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p51-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"inner","w":"hashimoto-masayoshi miyake-akito ryuuen-kakeru wang-mei-yu ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka gym exit  tail  and mii chan s interception gymnasium dispersal after hashimoto and kanzaki separate  then the dorm path thursday evening  feels incongruity   hashimoto no longer treats him as at the training camp  later confirms via front camera that hashimoto is tailing him into the cafe  if sakayanagi were monitoring him she would have used kamuro  not hashimoto  the tail may be hashimoto s own judgment  goes along with the delinquent talk  concludes miyake s ease with confrontation comes from growing up around fights  listens to miyake s history with ryuuen s neighbouring middle school and drops the thread    somebody else s problem  accepts mii chan s first ever face to face consultation  lets her choose the venue   keyaki mall cafe  for now ignores hashimoto and focuses on mii chan s conversation","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p51-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p51-1\">Gym exit, tail, and Mii-chan’s interception<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.51–56<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Gymnasium dispersal after Hashimoto and Kanzaki separate; then the dorm path Thursday evening.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/wang-mei-yu.html\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q inner\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> If Sakayanagi were monitoring him she would have used Kamuro, not Hashimoto; the tail may be Hashimoto’s own judgment.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Feels incongruity — Hashimoto no longer treats him as at the training camp; later confirms via front camera that Hashimoto is tailing him into the cafe.<span class=\"pg\">p.51–56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> Goes along with the delinquent talk; concludes Miyake’s ease with confrontation comes from growing up around fights.<span class=\"pg\">p.51–52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Listens to Miyake’s history with Ryuuen’s neighbouring middle school and drops the thread — “somebody else’s problem.”<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/b> Accepts Mii-chan’s first-ever face-to-face consultation; lets her choose the venue — Keyaki Mall cafe.<span class=\"pg\">p.54–56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Goal<\/span> For now ignores Hashimoto and focuses on Mii-chan’s conversation.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p43-1\">← Before: Gymnasium: Hashimoto against Kanzaki<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p56-1\">→ After: The Hirata question<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hasebe-haruka-y1v9-p51-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"hashimoto-masayoshi miyake-akito sakura-airi hasebe-haruka","q":"hasebe haruka gym farewell and the delinquent talk gym dispersal  haruka  airi and miyake stay talking after hashimoto leaves  wishes it would have gone longer  hashimoto s farewell gesture cuts her off  nudges the delinquent history talk and answers his privacy request with  were you really strong   somehow  i feel like we just witnessed something totally awesome   it doesn t matter  does it  you re different now anyway  were you really strong back then  stays in the group at the gym exit  both want the excitement to last  not at the cafe  only present for the dorm path walk after hashimoto s exit","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hasebe-haruka-y1v9-p51-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html#sc-hasebe-haruka-y1v9-p51-1\">Gym farewell and the delinquent talk<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.51–52<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Gym dispersal; Haruka, Airi and Miyake stay talking after Hashimoto leaves.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakura-airi.html\">Sakura Airi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> “Somehow, I feel like we just witnessed something totally awesome!”<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> “It doesn’t matter, does it? You’re different now anyway. Were you really strong back then?”<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Wishes it would have gone longer; Hashimoto’s farewell gesture cuts her off.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> Nudges the delinquent-history talk and answers his privacy request with “Were you really strong?”<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakura Airi<\/b> Stays in the group at the gym exit; both want the excitement to last.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Not at the cafe; only present for the dorm-path walk after Hashimoto’s exit.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hasebe-haruka-y1v9-p35-1\">← Before: Corridor watch and the cafe<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y1v9-p51-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"action spoken","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji hasebe-haruka ayanokouji-kiyotaka hashimoto-masayoshi","q":"hashimoto masayoshi leaving the gym  the dorm tail gym dispersal   hashimoto pats kanzaki s shoulder on the way out   haven t we said enough  even if we continue the conversation  we won t end up being able to agree on anything anyway  gestures farewell to haruka and airi and leaves toward the school building  ends the standoff by walking away while the conversation is declared unfinished  farewell gesture  haruka and airi stay with the group  ayanokoji feels incongruity in how hashimoto treats him now  later camera confirms hashimoto is following him and has come to the cafe  never looks at or speaks to ayanokoji while passing  purpose of the tail not stated on these pages","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y1v9-p51-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html#sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y1v9-p51-1\">Leaving the gym; the dorm tail<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.51, 53, 56<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Gym dispersal — Hashimoto pats Kanzaki’s shoulder on the way out.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> “Haven’t we said enough? Even if we continue the conversation, we won’t end up being able to agree on anything anyway.”<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Gestures farewell to Haruka and Airi and leaves toward the school building.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Ends the standoff by walking away while the conversation is declared unfinished.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Farewell gesture; Haruka and Airi stay with the group.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Ayanokōji feels incongruity in how Hashimoto treats him now; later camera-confirms Hashimoto is following him and has come to the cafe.<span class=\"pg\">p.51, 53, 56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Never looks at or speaks to Ayanokōji while passing; purpose of the tail not stated on these pages.<span class=\"pg\">p.53, 56<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y1v9-p43-1\">← Before: Gymnasium: accused of spreading the Ichinose rumors<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p51-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"action spoken","w":"hashimoto-masayoshi ichinose-honami hasebe-haruka kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji bowing out  reported to ichinose gym dispersal   kanzaki bows and leaves toward the dormitories  walks away while calling the conversation unfinished  hashimoto ends it   our conversation isn t over yet  bows to the group and goes toward the dormitories  reported later   ichinose says he is very gentle and that she told him she was alright  present in the farewell group  never at the cafe or the meeting  only the exit beat and ichinose s report of it","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p51-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html#sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p51-1\">Bowing out; reported to Ichinose<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.51, 72<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Gym dispersal — Kanzaki bows and leaves toward the dormitories.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> “Our conversation isn’t over yet.”<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Walks away while calling the conversation unfinished; Hashimoto ends it.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Bows to the group and goes toward the dormitories.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Reported later — Ichinose says he is very gentle and that she told him she was alright.<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Present in the farewell group.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Never at the cafe or the meeting; only the exit beat and Ichinose’s report of it.<span class=\"pg\">p.51, 72<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p43-1\">← Before: Gymnasium: tracing the rumors to Class A<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-miyake-akito-y1v9-p51-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru hasebe-haruka hashimoto-masayoshi miyake-akito","q":"miyake akito delinquent history and ryuuen s neighbourhood after the gym  the group walks back  haruka needles miyake about his past   i don t really wanna talk about it  haruka  i don t want it to spread around   let me just say this  i wasn t some famous delinquent  honestly  someone else was the top delinquent at the school i went to  and he was much stronger than me   by the way  class d s ryuuen went to the middle school right next to mine  their middle schools were neighbours  school conflicts brought them into contact    that guy probably never took me very seriously  asks her to keep the talk inside the group  answers her  were you really strong  with the top delinquent demotion  origin of his ease with confrontation   grown up where  adults would live a disordered life  and kids were raised the same  present at the gym dispersal that prompts the walk and talk  asks that the conversation not spread outside the group  ayanokoji agrees it is somebody else s problem","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-miyake-akito-y1v9-p51-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html#sc-miyake-akito-y1v9-p51-1\">Delinquent history and Ryuuen’s neighbourhood<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.51–52<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">After the gym, the group walks back; Haruka needles Miyake about his past.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> “I don’t really wanna talk about it, Haruka. I don’t want it to spread around.”<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> “Let me just say this, I wasn’t some famous delinquent. Honestly, someone else was the top delinquent at the school I went to, and he was much stronger than me.”<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> “By the way, Class D’s Ryuuen went to the middle school right next to mine.”<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Their middle schools were neighbours; school conflicts brought them into contact — “that guy probably never took me very seriously.”<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Asks her to keep the talk inside the group; answers her “were you really strong?” with the top-delinquent demotion.<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Origin of his ease with confrontation — grown up where “adults would live a disordered life” and kids were raised the same.<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Present at the gym dispersal that prompts the walk-and-talk.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Asks that the conversation not spread outside the group; Ayanokōji agrees it is somebody else’s problem.<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-miyake-akito-y1v9-p41-1\">← Before: Club call and gymnasium standoff<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sakura-airi-y1v9-p51-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"hasebe-haruka hashimoto-masayoshi sakura-airi","q":"sakura airi at the gym dispersal gymnasium exit with haruka  miyake and hashimoto s group before the walk back  present with her when hashimoto waves farewell and leaves  receives hashimoto s farewell gesture at the exit  only this beat in the chapter   she does not go to the cafe or the meeting","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sakura-airi-y1v9-p51-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sakura-airi.html#sc-sakura-airi-y1v9-p51-1\">At the gym dispersal<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.51<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sakura-airi.html\">Sakura Airi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Gymnasium exit with Haruka, Miyake and Hashimoto’s group before the walk back.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Present with her when Hashimoto waves farewell and leaves.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Receives Hashimoto’s farewell gesture at the exit.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Only this beat in the chapter — she does not go to the cafe or the meeting.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sakura-airi-y1v9-p36-1\">← Before: Cafe blush and the walk to Miyake<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y1v9-p52-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"miyake-akito ayanokouji-kiyotaka ryuuen-kakeru","q":"ryuen kakeru middle school neighbour and camp group ryuuen went to the middle school next to miyake s  the schools clashed several times    that guy probably never took me very seriously  framed through miyake s history as the stronger top delinquent of a rough neighbourhood school  named among the training camp group  with ishizaki  albert and ibuki    none of whom ayanokoji thinks would have told hashimoto anything  ryuuen is not present  only named in recollection and ayanokoji s elimination list","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y1v9-p52-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html#sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y1v9-p52-1\">Middle-school neighbour and camp group<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.52, 56<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> Ryuuen went to the middle school next to Miyake’s; the schools clashed several times — “That guy probably never took me very seriously.”<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Framed through Miyake’s history as the stronger top delinquent of a rough neighbourhood school.<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Named among the training-camp group (with Ishizaki, Albert and Ibuki) — none of whom Ayanokōji thinks would have told Hashimoto anything.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ryuuen is not present; only named in recollection and Ayanokōji’s elimination list.<span class=\"pg\">p.52, 56<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y1v9-p42-1\">← Before: Named as method and possible hidden hand<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y1v9-p52-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"hasebe-haruka yukimura-teruhiko","q":"yukimura teruhiko  yukimuu  in the dorm path talk haruka is told to leave the name out of the group  yukimuu is not present  named only in the aside about who else heard the delinquent talk  does not appear","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y1v9-p52-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html#sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y1v9-p52-1\">“Yukimuu” in the dorm-path talk<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.52<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Haruka is told to leave the name out of the group; Yukimuu is not present.<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Named only in the aside about who else heard the delinquent talk; does not appear.<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-yukimura-teruhiko-y1v9-p36-1\">← Before: Cafe: romance refused, exam plan set<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p53-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"action spoken","w":"shiina-hiyori kanzaki-ryuuji horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami alone  then the three way meeting thursday evening dorm path   ichinose walks alone without her usual ambition  ayanokoji watches her go  alone because she may be keeping friends out of the second disaster of her rumors  hiyori remembers the training camp bond and wants to help a mutual enemy  horikita s room at seven with ayanokoji   the direct meeting   ah  good evening ayanokouji kun   i absolutely can t speak with certainty here  but if i had to guess i d say it s sakayanagi san  names sakayanagi outright when asked who spreads the rumors   beyond ayanokoji s expectation for her   to put it simply  i guess it s because she declared war on class b  do i need to give you any other reason for it   sorry  horikita san  i m not able to tell you anything about that  horikita san and ayanokouji kun are friends  but you re still students from another class  we may be in a cooperative relationship with each other right now  but sooner or later  we re destined to fight against each other   i have absolutely no intention of giving this matter any excessive amount of energy  sakayanagi san s strategy is to stir up class b  i think the correct solution for dealing with it is to simply stay silent  chooses silence over denial or a culprit hunt  smile unchanged through the harassment talk   typical bullying with no perfect solution   so  horikita san and the rest of class c can continue doing things as usual  i will clean up my own mess  came only to tell class c not to interfere  stands to leave after saying it  says kanzaki is very gentle and that she told him she was alright   no need for more from him   i see  kanzaki kun is very gentle  i told him i was alright  i didn t think i needed to say anything more to him  refuses horikita s push to deny the rumors  assures her class c can continue as usual  thanks him for coming out late  waits outside and pulls him into the elevator for a walk   can you keep me company for a little bit  still smiling and initiative taking after the meeting   waves him over and takes him outside the lobby  never says whether the rumors are true  only the sakayanagi attribution is stated as her guess","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p53-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p53-1\">Alone, then the three-way meeting<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.53, 66–75<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Thursday evening dorm path — Ichinose walks alone without her usual ambition; Ayanokōji watches her go. Horikita’s room at seven with Ayanokōji — the direct meeting.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> “Ah! Good evening Ayanokouji-kun.”<span class=\"pg\">p.69<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> “I absolutely can’t speak with certainty here, but if I had to guess I’d say it’s Sakayanagi-san.”<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> “To put it simply, I guess it’s because she declared war on Class B. Do I need to give you any other reason for it?”<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>15 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> Alone because she may be keeping friends out of the second disaster of her rumors.<span class=\"pg\">p.53<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Hiyori remembers the training-camp bond and wants to help a mutual enemy.<span class=\"pg\">p.66–67<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Names Sakayanagi outright when asked who spreads the rumors — beyond Ayanokōji’s expectation for her.<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Sorry, Horikita-san. I’m not able to tell you anything about that. Horikita-san and Ayanokouji-kun are friends, but you’re still students from another class. We may be in a cooperative relationship with each other right now, but sooner or later, we’re destined to fight against each other.”<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I have absolutely no intention of giving this matter any excessive amount of energy. Sakayanagi-san’s strategy is to stir up Class B, I think the correct solution for dealing with it is to simply stay silent.”<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Chooses silence over denial or a culprit hunt; smile unchanged through the harassment talk — typical bullying with no perfect solution.<span class=\"pg\">p.71–72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “So, Horikita-san and the rest of Class C can continue doing things as usual. I will clean up my own mess.”<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Came only to tell Class C not to interfere; stands to leave after saying it.<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Says Kanzaki is very gentle and that she told him she was alright — no need for more from him.<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I see… Kanzaki-kun is very gentle. I told him I was alright. I didn’t think I needed to say anything more to him.”<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Refuses Horikita’s push to deny the rumors; assures her Class C can continue as usual.<span class=\"pg\">p.69–73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Thanks him for coming out late; waits outside and pulls him into the elevator for a walk.<span class=\"pg\">p.69–75<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Can you keep me company for a little bit?”<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Position<\/span> Still smiling and initiative-taking after the meeting — waves him over and takes him outside the lobby.<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Never says whether the rumors are true; only the Sakayanagi attribution is stated as her guess.<span class=\"pg\">p.69–72<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y1v9-p31-1\">← Before: Slandered at a distance<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-wang-mei-yu-y1v9-p54-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"hirata-yousuke ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiina-hiyori wang-mei-yu","q":"wang mei yu the hirata consultation dorm path to keyaki mall cafe   mii chan intercepts ayanokoji for his first face to face talk with her   ah  um  ayanokouji kun  do you have a moment   how about the cafe  if that s alright with you  though we might be somewhat late in heading back home afterward  wants to know whether hirata likes anyone after the karuizawa breakup  cites hirata naming ayanokoji the most reliable person in class   hey  uh  it s about hirata kun   but then  why did hirata kun advise me that ayanokouji kun was the most reliable person in the class   do you know if there s anyone  h hirata kun likes right now  crush since the entrance ceremony   one gentle encounter  she fears rivals and her own inexperience   right after the entrance ceremony   i  i don t think i m good enough to become hirata kun s girlfriend    too many rivals  never been in love before  client of his patient advice  later says he seemed scary from a distance but is approachable face to face   oh no  you re totally fine  everyone calls me that  even though both my parents are chinese  they both like my japanese nickname  so even they call me mii chan  studying abroad   father came to japan on business when she was in first year of middle school  not half japanese  close across classes  panics at the  on a date  joke  asks whether cross class friends are great   n n no  not at all hiyori chan  opens up once asked directly  blushing through the entrance ceremony memory  then clouded by reality  p 59 blank between the two halves of the cafe talk","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-wang-mei-yu-y1v9-p54-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/wang-mei-yu.html#sc-wang-mei-yu-y1v9-p54-1\">The Hirata consultation<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.54–65<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/wang-mei-yu.html\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Dorm path to Keyaki Mall cafe — Mii-chan intercepts Ayanokōji for his first face-to-face talk with her.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/b> “Ah, um, Ayanokouji-kun. Do you have a moment…?”<span class=\"pg\">p.54<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/b> “How about the cafe… if that’s alright with you? Though we might be somewhat late in heading back home afterward.”<span class=\"pg\">p.55<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/b> “Hey… Uh, it’s about Hirata-kun.”<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>13 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Goal<\/span> Wants to know whether Hirata likes anyone after the Karuizawa breakup; cites Hirata naming Ayanokōji the most reliable person in class.<span class=\"pg\">p.56–57<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “But then, why did Hirata-kun advise me that Ayanokouji-kun was the most reliable person in the class?”<span class=\"pg\">p.57<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “…Do you know if there’s anyone, H-Hirata-kun likes right now?”<span class=\"pg\">p.57<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Crush since the entrance ceremony — one gentle encounter; she fears rivals and her own inexperience.<span class=\"pg\">p.57–62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “-Right after the entrance ceremony?”<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> “I… I don’t think I’m good enough to become Hirata-kun’s girlfriend…” — too many rivals, never been in love before.<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Client of his patient advice; later says he seemed scary from a distance but is approachable face-to-face.<span class=\"pg\">p.54–65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Oh no, you’re totally fine. Everyone calls me that. Even though both my parents are Chinese, they both like my Japanese nickname, so even they call me Mii-chan.”<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Detail<\/span> Studying abroad — father came to Japan on business when she was in first year of middle school; not half-Japanese.<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Close across classes; panics at the “on a date?” joke; asks whether cross-class friends are great.<span class=\"pg\">p.63–65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “N-N-No! Not at all Hiyori-chan!”<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Opens up once asked directly; blushing through the entrance-ceremony memory, then clouded by reality.<span class=\"pg\">p.60–62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> p.59 blank between the two halves of the cafe talk.<span class=\"pg\">p.59<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p56-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"hirata-yousuke wang-mei-yu ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka the hirata question asked who hirata likes after the karuizawa breakup  answers honestly that there is nobody and advises patience because hirata will be careful next time   i don t think so  asks mii chan when she started liking hirata and delivers a cold read of confess soon odds    you re probably going to be rejected if you get impatient and confess to him so soon  coach for her first crush  her communication still needs the work airi also needs  and he does not break the ice until she starts  her compliment that he is approachable is met with his own note that he is only running an unconscious analysis of what will be useful to her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p56-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p56-1\">The Hirata question<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.56–62<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/wang-mei-yu.html\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> “I don’t think so.”<span class=\"pg\">p.58<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Asked who Hirata likes after the Karuizawa breakup; answers honestly that there is nobody and advises patience because Hirata will be careful next time.<span class=\"pg\">p.56–62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Asks Mii-chan when she started liking Hirata and delivers a cold read of confess-soon odds — “you’re probably going to be rejected if you get impatient and confess to him so soon.”<span class=\"pg\">p.60–62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/b> Coach for her first crush; her communication still needs the work Airi also needs, and he does not break the ice until she starts.<span class=\"pg\">p.56–62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Her compliment that he is approachable is met with his own note that he is only running an unconscious analysis of what will be useful to her.<span class=\"pg\">p.62<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p51-1\">← Before: Gym exit, tail, and Mii-chan’s interception<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p63-1\">→ After: Reading buddies, mailbox, Hiyori’s ask<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hirata-yousuke-y1v9-p56-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"wang-mei-yu ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei hirata-yousuke","q":"hirata yosuke mii chan s crush  ayanokoji s counsel she likes him since the entrance ceremony  ayanokoji reads that he will be careful next time and that a hasty confession now means rejection  cited as hirata s own endorsement    the most reliable person in the class  the breakup with karuizawa is the precondition for mii chan s question  ayanokoji notes nobody has seen him with anyone since  answered honestly  i don t think so    no known interest  his position as class mediator noted by ayanokoji  does not appear in person  only the subject of the cafe consultation","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hirata-yousuke-y1v9-p56-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html#sc-hirata-yousuke-y1v9-p56-1\">Mii-chan’s crush, Ayanokōji’s counsel<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.56–62<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/wang-mei-yu.html\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/b> She likes him since the entrance ceremony; Ayanokōji reads that he will be careful next time and that a hasty confession now means rejection.<span class=\"pg\">p.56–62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Cited as Hirata’s own endorsement — “the most reliable person in the class.”<span class=\"pg\">p.57<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> The breakup with Karuizawa is the precondition for Mii-chan’s question; Ayanokōji notes nobody has seen him with anyone since.<span class=\"pg\">p.56–57<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> Answered honestly “I don’t think so” — no known interest; his position as class mediator noted by Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.58–60<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Does not appear in person; only the subject of the cafe consultation.<span class=\"pg\">p.56–62<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hirata-yousuke-y1v9-p28-1\">← Before: Dumped in public, unmoved<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ibuki-mio-y1v9-p56-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"ryuuen-kakeru ibuki-mio","q":"ibuki mio camp group in ayanokoji s elimination list named with ryuuen  ishizaki and albert as the training camp group  does not appear  only in the internal list","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ibuki-mio-y1v9-p56-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ibuki-mio.html#sc-ibuki-mio-y1v9-p56-1\">Camp group in Ayanokōji’s elimination list<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.56<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ibuki-mio.html\">Ibuki Mio<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Named with Ryuuen, Ishizaki and Albert as the training-camp group.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Does not appear; only in the internal list.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ishizaki-daichi-y1v9-p56-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"ryuuen-kakeru ishizaki-daichi","q":"ishizaki daichi camp group in ayanokoji s elimination list named with ryuuen  albert and ibuki as the training camp group   none of whom ayanokoji thinks told hashimoto anything  does not appear  only in the internal list","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ishizaki-daichi-y1v9-p56-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html#sc-ishizaki-daichi-y1v9-p56-1\">Camp group in Ayanokōji’s elimination list<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.56<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Named with Ryuuen, Albert and Ibuki as the training-camp group — none of whom Ayanokōji thinks told Hashimoto anything.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Does not appear; only in the internal list.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ishizaki-daichi-y1v9-p19-1\">← Before: Class D–Class C fight recalled as precedent<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kamuro-masumi-y1v9-p56-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"sakayanagi-arisu hashimoto-masayoshi kamuro-masumi","q":"kamuro masumi named as sakayanagi s preferred monitor cafe sugar counter   ayanokoji reasons about hashimoto s tail  his read  if sakayanagi wanted tabs on him she would have forced kamuro to do it  not hashimoto  implied contrast   kamuro is the type sakayanagi would trust with a covert watch  hashimoto is not  kamuro does not appear  only named in ayanokoji s internal elimination of who could be tailing him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kamuro-masumi-y1v9-p56-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kamuro-masumi.html#sc-kamuro-masumi-y1v9-p56-1\">Named as Sakayanagi’s preferred monitor<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.56<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kamuro-masumi.html\">Kamuro Masumi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Cafe sugar counter — Ayanokōji reasons about Hashimoto’s tail.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> His read: if Sakayanagi wanted tabs on him she would have forced Kamuro to do it, not Hashimoto.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Implied contrast — Kamuro is the type Sakayanagi would trust with a covert watch; Hashimoto is not.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Kamuro does not appear; only named in Ayanokōji’s internal elimination of who could be tailing him.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y1v9-p56-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"hirata-yousuke ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei the breakup as premise mentioned as his ex girlfriend   the reason mii chan now asks whether he likes anyone  no one has seen him with anyone since  ayanokoji s internal note  mii chan would have asked if hirata were already dating  he reads the answer as honest  does not appear  only named in the breakup context","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y1v9-p56-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y1v9-p56-1\">The breakup as premise<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.56–57<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Mentioned as his ex-girlfriend — the reason Mii-chan now asks whether he likes anyone; no one has seen him with anyone since.<span class=\"pg\">p.56–57<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Ayanokōji’s internal note: Mii-chan would have asked if Hirata were already dating; he reads the answer as honest.<span class=\"pg\">p.57<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Does not appear; only named in the breakup context.<span class=\"pg\">p.56–57<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y1v9-p28-1\">← Before: Public breakup with Hirata<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y1v9-p56-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"hashimoto-masayoshi ichinose-honami horikita-suzune katsuragi-kouhei sakayanagi-arisu","q":"sakayanagi arisu named as the rumor source ayanokoji reasons she would have used kamuro to monitor him  not hashimoto   so the tail may not be hers  ichinose names her as the probable source because she declared war on class b   i absolutely can t speak with certainty here  but if i had to guess i d say it s sakayanagi san  horikita agrees the guess needs no further reason  sakayanagi does not appear  her intra class war to defeat katsuragi is the pattern behind the expected assault on class b s leader  never present  only named as source  monitor employer  and past class a aggressor","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y1v9-p56-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html#sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y1v9-p56-1\">Named as the rumor source<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.56, 70–71<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> “I absolutely can’t speak with certainty here, but if I had to guess I’d say it’s Sakayanagi-san.”<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Ayanokōji reasons she would have used Kamuro to monitor him, not Hashimoto — so the tail may not be hers.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Ichinose names her as the probable source because she declared war on Class B.<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Horikita agrees the guess needs no further reason; Sakayanagi does not appear.<span class=\"pg\">p.70–71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> Her intra-class war to defeat Katsuragi is the pattern behind the expected assault on Class B’s leader.<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Never present; only named as source, monitor-employer, and past Class A aggressor.<span class=\"pg\">p.56–71<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y1v9-p33-1\">← Before: Summoning Yamauchi from Class C<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-yamada-albert-y1v9-p56-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"ryuuen-kakeru yamada-albert","q":"yamada albert camp group in ayanokoji s elimination list named with ryuuen  ishizaki and ibuki as the training camp group  does not appear  only in the internal list","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-yamada-albert-y1v9-p56-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/yamada-albert.html#sc-yamada-albert-y1v9-p56-1\">Camp group in Ayanokōji’s elimination list<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.56<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/yamada-albert.html\">Yamada Albert<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Named with Ryuuen, Ishizaki and Ibuki as the training-camp group.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Does not appear; only in the internal list.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p63-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"shiina-hiyori wang-mei-yu ichinose-honami horikita-suzune ayanokouji-atsuomi ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka reading buddies  mailbox  hiyori s ask cover story about china  lobby wait where she asks him to cooperate on helping ichinose  he declines the direct lever  names pingyao ancient city when hiyori mentions the great wall   surprises mii chan  parted at the elevator after the china detour  sees her walking alone to the dorms  with hiyori  refuses to name sakayanagi or hashimoto as sources  wary the rumors may be closer to truth than they appear  answers her text and agrees to the seven o clock meeting with ichinose  checks his mailbox regularly ever since his father visited the school   expects possible contact   cooperate  huh  if that s the case  then you should consult horikita   i don t have any influence over class c at all","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p63-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p63-1\">Reading buddies, mailbox, Hiyori’s ask<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.63–68<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/wang-mei-yu.html\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-atsuomi.html\">Ayanokōji Atsuomi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> “Cooperate, huh? If that’s the case, then you should consult Horikita.”<span class=\"pg\">p.67<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> “I don’t have any influence over Class C at all.”<span class=\"pg\">p.67<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Cover story about China; lobby wait where she asks him to cooperate on helping Ichinose; he declines the direct lever.<span class=\"pg\">p.63–68<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Names Pingyao Ancient City when Hiyori mentions the Great Wall — surprises Mii-chan.<span class=\"pg\">p.64<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/b> Parted at the elevator after the China detour.<span class=\"pg\">p.63–65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Sees her walking alone to the dorms; with Hiyori, refuses to name Sakayanagi or Hashimoto as sources; wary the rumors may be closer to truth than they appear.<span class=\"pg\">p.53, 66–68<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Answers her text and agrees to the seven o’clock meeting with Ichinose.<span class=\"pg\">p.68–69<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Atsuomi<\/b> Checks his mailbox regularly ever since his father visited the school — expects possible contact.<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p56-1\">← Before: The Hirata question<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p69-1\">→ After: The three-way meeting and the elevator<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiina-hiyori-y1v9-p63-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"wang-mei-yu ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami horikita-suzune shiina-hiyori","q":"shiina hiyori reading buddies and the ichinose offer keyaki mall cafe   hiyori  class d  spots mii chan with ayanokoji and asks to join   oh  mii chan and  ayanokouji kun   are the two of you  by any chance  on a date together  close cross class friends    reading buddies  china talk with ayanokoji covers for the real consultation  when mii chan asks whether the two are friends  one of them answers  yep  we re reading buddies  and the other  well  you re not wrong    the translation tags no speaker  neither line is attributed here  waits for him in the lobby after the mailbox and asks him to cooperate on helping ichinose   that thing going on right now with ichinose san  have you heard anything about it   honestly  i don t want to see ichinose san tortured like this anymore  she s the type of person who s even willing to be friendly to somebody with barely any friends  like me  training camp bond  wants class d  and maybe three classes  to help a mutual enemy without worsening ichinose s load   when i first came here  i didn t like this behavior that the school encourages  where we hurt others  but now  i think it s necessary to fight from time to time in order to protect your friends   even though we re mutual enemies with ichinose san  there must be something we can do to help her  i haven t been able to think of how yet  but  would you be willing to cooperate with me  disappointed that the levers are horikita and hirata   she does not know them  defers the introduction  changes her mind about starting the conversation tonight so as not to spread the trouble any further   i m sorry  let s do it at another time  if our conversation helps spread things any further  we may end up troubling ichinose by just that much more","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y1v9-p63-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html#sc-shiina-hiyori-y1v9-p63-1\">Reading buddies and the Ichinose offer<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.63–68<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Keyaki Mall cafe — Hiyori (Class D) spots Mii-chan with Ayanokōji and asks to join.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/wang-mei-yu.html\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> “Oh? Mii-chan and… Ayanokouji-kun?”<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> “Are the two of you, by any chance, on a date together?”<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> “That thing going on right now with Ichinose-san, have you heard anything about it?”<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>10 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/b> Close cross-class friends — “reading buddies”; China talk with Ayanokōji covers for the real consultation.<span class=\"pg\">p.63–65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> When Mii-chan asks whether the two are friends, one of them answers “Yep! We’re reading buddies.” and the other “Well, you’re not wrong.” — the translation tags no speaker; neither line is attributed here.<span class=\"pg\">p.64<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Waits for him in the lobby after the mailbox and asks him to cooperate on helping Ichinose.<span class=\"pg\">p.63–68<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Honestly, I don’t want to see Ichinose-san tortured like this anymore. She’s the type of person who’s even willing to be friendly to somebody with barely any friends, like me.”<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Training-camp bond; wants Class D (and maybe three classes) to help a mutual enemy without worsening Ichinose’s load.<span class=\"pg\">p.66–67<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “When I first came here, I didn’t like this behavior that the school encourages, where we hurt others. But now, I think it’s necessary to fight from time to time in order to protect your friends.”<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Even though we’re mutual enemies with Ichinose-san, there must be something we can do to help her. I haven’t been able to think of how yet, but… would you be willing to cooperate with me?”<span class=\"pg\">p.67<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Disappointed that the levers are Horikita and Hirata — she does not know them; defers the introduction.<span class=\"pg\">p.67<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Changes her mind about starting the conversation tonight so as not to spread the trouble any further.<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I’m sorry, let’s do it at another time. If our conversation helps spread things any further, we may end up troubling Ichinose by just that much more.”<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-horikita-suzune-y1v9-p68-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami sakayanagi-arisu ayanokouji-kiyotaka kushida-kikyou horikita-suzune","q":"horikita suzune summoning ichinose  the cold hearted counsel texts ayanokoji from her room  ichinose is coming at seven under the class b alliance   you around   since the message has been marked as read  i ll just continue talking as that s more convenient  ichinose san will be coming to my room tonight  will you come   we re in an alliance with class b  it s only natural that we d lend a hand given the current state of affairs  but  this time we don t know the full story  therefore  i was thinking of hearing about it from the person herself  hears ichinose directly rather than through reports  keeps the meeting to a weekday seven so as not to look suspicious  asks who spreads the rumors and whether she will deny them  accepts ichinose s refusal without forcing it   yes  do you know who has been spreading those rumors   are you not going to deny the rumors   i don t mean to force you to say anything here  but you do know that silence can be interpreted as though you re saying the rumors are true  right  agrees ichinose s sakayanagi guess needs no further reason   war on class b and her warlike pattern  asks his genuine opinion after ichinose leaves  calls him cold hearted when he advises doing nothing  ends the night lost in thought   what do you think i should do   so you re saying it doesn t matter what happens to ichinose san  you re being quite cold hearted  accepts  leave it alone  without strong objection   understands it is right  ayanokoji reads her as changing but still too extreme  losing sight of herself  ayanokoji guesses horikita s growth is tied to her effort to improve the relationship with kushida  does not stop ichinose from leaving  the final elevator beat is ichinose and ayanokoji  not horikita","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y1v9-p68-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html#sc-horikita-suzune-y1v9-p68-1\">Summoning Ichinose; the cold-hearted counsel<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.68–75<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Texts Ayanokōji from her room: Ichinose is coming at seven under the Class B alliance.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> “[You around?]”<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> “[Since the message has been marked as read, I’ll just continue talking as that’s more convenient. Ichinose-san will be coming to my room tonight. Will you come?]”<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> “[We’re in an alliance with Class B. It’s only natural that we’d lend a hand given the current state of affairs. But, this time we don’t know the full story. Therefore, I was thinking of hearing about it from the person herself.]”<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>12 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Goal<\/span> Hears Ichinose directly rather than through reports; keeps the meeting to a weekday seven so as not to look suspicious.<span class=\"pg\">p.68–72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Asks who spreads the rumors and whether she will deny them; accepts Ichinose’s refusal without forcing it.<span class=\"pg\">p.69–72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Yes. Do you know who has been spreading those rumors?”<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Are you not going to deny the rumors?”<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I don’t mean to force you to say anything here, but you do know that silence can be interpreted as though you’re saying the rumors are true, right?”<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Agrees Ichinose’s Sakayanagi guess needs no further reason — war on Class B and her warlike pattern.<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Asks his genuine opinion after Ichinose leaves; calls him cold-hearted when he advises doing nothing; ends the night lost in thought.<span class=\"pg\">p.73–75<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “What do you think I should do?”<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “…So you’re saying it doesn’t matter what happens to Ichinose-san? You’re being quite cold-hearted.”<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Accepts “leave it alone” without strong objection — understands it is right; Ayanokōji reads her as changing but still too extreme, losing sight of herself.<span class=\"pg\">p.74–75<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> Ayanokōji guesses Horikita’s growth is tied to her effort to improve the relationship with Kushida.<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Does not stop Ichinose from leaving; the final elevator beat is Ichinose and Ayanokōji, not Horikita.<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-horikita-suzune-y1v9-p28-1\">← Before: The breakup question, the slander note, blocking Yamauchi<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p69-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"inner spoken","w":"ichinose-honami horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka the three way meeting and the elevator horikita s room at seven   ichinose arrives in the neighbouring elevator  witnesses her name sakayanagi  her refusal to deny the rumors  and her  clean up my own mess  line  later pulled into the elevator for a walk  advises her to do nothing after she asks for a genuine opinion  notes horikita changing but still losing sight of herself  helping ichinose may pull sakayanagi s eye to class c  if class b falls first  that is an upside for class c   you should leave it alone  closing assessment  horikita s changes are too extreme right now  she must get along with others before she can reach her true self  waves him into the elevator    can you keep me company for a little bit    and takes him outside the lobby","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p69-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p69-1\">The three-way meeting and the elevator<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.69–75<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Horikita’s room at seven — Ichinose arrives in the neighbouring elevator.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q inner\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Helping Ichinose may pull Sakayanagi’s eye to Class C; if Class B falls first, that is an upside for Class C.<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> “You should leave it alone.”<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Witnesses her name Sakayanagi, her refusal to deny the rumors, and her “clean up my own mess” line; later pulled into the elevator for a walk.<span class=\"pg\">p.69–75<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Advises her to do nothing after she asks for a genuine opinion; notes Horikita changing but still losing sight of herself.<span class=\"pg\">p.69–75<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Closing assessment: Horikita’s changes are too extreme right now; she must get along with others before she can reach her true self.<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Waves him into the elevator — “Can you keep me company for a little bit?” — and takes him outside the lobby.<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y1v9-p63-1\">← Before: Reading buddies, mailbox, Hiyori’s ask<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y1v9-p70-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"sakayanagi-arisu katsuragi-kouhei","q":"katsuragi kohei sakayanagi s class a pattern recalled narration  sakayanagi deepened conflict inside her own class to defeat katsuragi   the pattern ichinose and horikita use to expect an assault on class b s leader  katsuragi does not appear  only named as the past target of sakayanagi s intra class war","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y1v9-p70-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html#sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y1v9-p70-1\">Sakayanagi’s Class A pattern recalled<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.70<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Narration: Sakayanagi deepened conflict inside her own class to defeat Katsuragi — the pattern Ichinose and Horikita use to expect an assault on Class B’s leader.<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Katsuragi does not appear; only named as the past target of Sakayanagi’s intra-class war.<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y1v9-p49-1\">← Before: Named as the other Class A authority<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kushida-kikyou-y1v9-p74-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"horikita-suzune kushida-kikyou","q":"kushida kikyo named in ayanokoji s growth theory ayanokoji guesses horikita s changes are tied to her effort to improve their relationship   kushida is the reason for the effort  does not appear  only named in ayanokoji s assessment of horikita","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kushida-kikyou-y1v9-p74-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html#sc-kushida-kikyou-y1v9-p74-1\">Named in Ayanokōji’s growth theory<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.74<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Ayanokōji guesses Horikita’s changes are tied to her effort to improve their relationship — Kushida is the reason for the effort.<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Does not appear; only named in Ayanokōji’s assessment of Horikita.<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kushida-kikyou-y1v9-p24-1\">← Before: Outside the student council room<\/button><\/div><\/article>"}];
